      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Accrual" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Auto-generated primary key for the accrual policy record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`sql/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n- Generated by the database on INSERT using $getGeneratedKeys = true; the returned Id is mapped back onto the accrual model after creation.\n\n[`service/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n- Retrieved from generatedKeys after a successful insert: $gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id\n\n[`service/accrual/UpdateAccrual.gloop`]\n- Used as the WHERE clause key when selecting an existing accrual to validate it exists before applying updates.\n- Returned 404 if no record is found: \"'Accrual' record not found.\"\n\n[`service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Used to look up accrual policies by cycle/company and iterate their linked AccrualBalance records for automated processing.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 10, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Human-readable display name for the accrual policy (e.g., \"Annual Leave\", \"Sick Leave\").\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`sql/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n[`sql/accrual/UpdateAccrual.gloop`]\n- Persisted directly to the ACCRUAL table. On update, uses COALESCE so null-valued fields are left unchanged.\n\n[`service/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n[`service/accrual/UpdateAccrual.gloop`]\n- Redacted in the audit log after a successful write: (accrual.Name) ? \"Redacted\" : accrual.Name\n- This means the tracker record never exposes the actual policy name.\n\n[`service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- When loading accrual balances during payroll assembly, the Name is transformed to ensure it contains \"Leave Credits\":\n    - If Name already contains \"LEAVE CREDITS\" → used as-is\n    - If Name contains \"LEAVE\" → \" Credits\" appended\n    - Otherwise → \" Leave Credits\" appended\n- This display-name normalization applies only to the runtime payroll context; the stored Name is unchanged.\n\n[`service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Name is read from the ACCRUAL table and compared with the AccrualBalance.AccrualName snapshot. If they differ, the new Name is propagated to update the balance's cached AccrualName.\n\n**Example:** `Vacation`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 10, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the accrual policy is currently active and eligible for use in payroll processing.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is currently not actively used to gate or filter downstream processing. It is loaded during payroll data assembly and available for future enforcement logic.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`sql/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n[`sql/accrual/UpdateAccrual.gloop`]\n- Stored in the database as an integer (1 = true, 0 = false, null = null).\n  Insert expression: accrual.Active == null ? null : (accrual.Active ? 1 : 0)\n  Update uses COALESCE so omitting the field leaves the existing value unchanged.\n\n[`service/accrual/InsertAccrual.gloop`]\n[`service/accrual/UpdateAccrual.gloop`]\n- Converted from boolean to integer before being passed to the SQL layer.\n\n[`service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- The Active flag is loaded onto the Accrual sub-model of each AccrualBalance entry during payroll data assembly, allowing downstream services to inspect policy status.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 10, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Code" : {
            "type" : "string",
