      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Company" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the company record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before logging to the tracker and invoking `CreateAccrualScheduler`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from `SelectCompany` produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/ValidateCompany.gloop`]\n- Passed as `CompanyId` to `SelectCompany`; a null result throws an exception re-raised as 404, blocking any service that requires a valid company reference.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Used within the soft-delete SQL `CONCAT` expressions to generate the placeholder strings for anonymized fields (e.g., `'Deleted Company {Id} Legal Name'`).\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the company is currently active. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nNOTE: This property is not currently used as a processing gate in any payroll run or accrual processing logic. `ValidateCompany` uses `SelectCompany` which only filters on `Deleted = 0`, not on `Active`. It is persisted for administrative visibility and future enforcement.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `company.Active == null ? null : (company.Active ? 1 : 0)`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Same integer conversion applied on UPDATE via COALESCE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `0` (false) by the soft-delete SQL, in addition to setting `Deleted = 1`.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "LegalName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The official legal name of the company as registered, used for compliance and legal documentation purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE(:LegalName, \"LegalName\")`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Company {Id} Legal Name'`.\n\nNOTE: Database-level constraints (not the service layer) enforce that `LegalName` is not null and unique per company. Violations are handled through `GenerateExceptionResponse`.\n\n**Example:** `Acme Corporation Inc.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TradeName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The company's operating or trading name used for display and business communications.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Company {Id} Trade Name'`.\n\nNOTE: Database-level constraints (not the service layer) enforce that `TradeName` is not null and unique per company. Violations are handled through `GenerateExceptionResponse`.\n\n**Example:** `Acme Corp`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PrimaryAddressLocation" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The primary physical address or location of the company.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; no validation beyond storage.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Company {Id} Primary Address Location'`.\n\n**Example:** `123 Main Street, San Francisco, CA 94105`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
