          "PrimaryContactUrl" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The company's primary website or portal URL.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; no validation beyond storage.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Company {Id} Primary Contact Url'`.\n\n**Example:** `https://www.acmecorp.com`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FiscalYearStart" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The start date of the company's fiscal year, stored in `MM-dd` format (e.g., `\"01-01\"` for January 1). Defines the opening boundary of the fiscal year for accrual processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Validated against the regex `^(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])$`; a format mismatch throws an exception and returns 400 \"Invalid fiscal year start/end date format (MM-dd).\"\n- Note: Unlike `FiscalYearEnd`, `FiscalYearStart` does not drive scheduler creation or deletion and is not parsed through `getValidMonthDay()` in the current implementation — only `FiscalYearEnd` drives scheduler naming.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Parsed at accrual processing time: the month and day components are extracted and combined with the current calendar year to compute `CompanyFiscalYearStart` as a full `Date`. This boundary is used alongside `CompanyFiscalYearEnd` to determine whether the current date falls within the company's fiscal year before applying accrual increments.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Explicitly preserved on soft-delete (the `FiscalYearStart` overwrite is commented out in the SQL), ensuring the value remains available for any post-deletion references.\n\n**Example:** `01-01`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FiscalYearEnd" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The end date of the company's fiscal year, stored in `MM-dd` format (e.g., `\"12-31\"` for December 31). This value directly drives the naming and lifecycle of the company's accrual carry-forward scheduler.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Validated against the regex `^(0[1-9]|1[0-2])-(0[1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[01])$`; invalid format throws 400.\n- The day component is further validated via `getValidMonthDay()` using the current year, and the result is re-formatted with `padLeft(2, '0')` before being stored. This means the persisted value may differ from the raw input if the supplied day was out of range.\n- After successful insert, `CreateAccrualScheduler` is called with the extracted `endMonth` and `endDay`, creating a scheduler named `Month{MM}Day{DD}AccrualCarryForwardScheduler`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- When `FiscalYearEnd` is provided on update, the same format validation and `getValidMonthDay()` processing applies. `UpdateAccrualScheduler` is called after the database update, which deletes the old scheduler (if no other company shares the same fiscal year end date) and creates a new one with the updated timing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Parsed after soft-delete to extract `endMonth` and `endDay`, which are used to construct the scheduler name for `DeleteAccrualScheduler`.\n- Explicitly preserved on soft-delete (the `FiscalYearEnd` overwrite is commented out in the SQL) precisely so it remains available for this scheduler cleanup step.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/SelectAllCompanyByFiscalYearEnd.gloop`]\n- Used in `ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance` to find all companies whose fiscal year ends on a given date, scoping the carry-forward processing batch to those companies.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Parsed at accrual processing time: month and day are extracted and combined with the current (or next) calendar year to compute `CompanyFiscalYearEnd` as a full `Date`, accounting for fiscal years that span a calendar year boundary. The current date is checked against this boundary to gate accrual balance updates.\n\n**Example:** `12-31`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CountryId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `Country` record for the company's primary geographic location.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; validated via `ValidateCountryAndState` together with `StateId` to confirm the country exists and that the state (if provided) belongs to that country.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; `ValidateCountryAndState` is only invoked when `CountryId` is explicitly provided in the update payload. Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "StateId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key referencing the `State` record for the company's sub-national location. Only meaningful when the company's country has states or provinces.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Validated together with `CountryId` via `ValidateCountryAndState`; the service confirms that if `StateId` is provided, it belongs to the specified country. Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the company record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the company record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a company field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Persisted alongside `CreatedDate` in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the company record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`); not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the company record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/UpdateCompany.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the company record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/SelectCompany.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the company record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteCompanyInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
