          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this company record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/company/SelectCompany.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/DeleteCompany.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1) via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same SQL statement also sets `Active = 0` and overwrites the five sensitive data fields with placeholder strings. The record is never physically removed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/company/InsertCompany.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
