      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Accrual_Balance" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the accrual balance record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true); returned in the API response as confirmation of the created record.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in SELECT-before-mutate checks; a null result from the lookup produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Passed as `accrualbalance.Id` into `UpdateAccrualBalance` during automated scheduler-driven accrual processing and fiscal year-end carry-forward processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Duplicate-check uses `SelectAccrualBalanceByAccrualAndWorker`; if a record with a non-null Id already exists for the same `(AccrualId, WorkerId)` pair, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccruedAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Running total of leave units earned by the worker through accrual processing cycles within the current fiscal year.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Defaults to 0 when not explicitly supplied (`accrualbalance.AccruedAmount ?: 0`) before the INSERT is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Incremented each scheduler cycle by adding the policy's `AccrualRate` to the existing value: `accrual_balance_AccruedAmount + accrual_AccrualRate`.\n- Increment is blocked when `AccruedAmount + AccrualRate` would exceed the policy's `MaxAnnualAccrual`; in that case the entire update for this worker-accrual pair is cancelled.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Reset to 0 at fiscal year-end for all balances, regardless of `CanCarryForward` setting; the carry-forward amount is written into `CarryOver` and `Balance` instead.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview; not modified during payroll run processing.\n\n**Example:** `40.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Balance" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Current available leave units that the worker can consume or encash; represents AccruedAmount + CarryOver - Used.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that Balance is not null before the INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Increased each accrual cycle by `AccrualRate`: `accrual_balance_Balance + accrual_AccrualRate`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Reset at fiscal year-end: set to `0 + (CarryOver ?: 0)`, so only carried-over units survive into the new year.\n- When `CanCarryForward = 1`, the reset value is `min(Balance, CarryForwardLimit)` (written to CarryOver first, then Balance is derived from it).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Read during payroll encashment to calculate `EncashableBalance` (FLAT method: `min(Balance, Earning.Amount)`; PERCENT method: `Balance * Earning.Amount`).\n- Reduced by `EncashableBalance` after encashment: `Balance - EncashableBalance` is written to the PaySlip preview and subsequently persisted as the updated balance.\n\n**Example:** `32.50`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "LastAccrualDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent accrual processing cycle that successfully updated this balance record.\n\nNOTE: This property is not consumed by any downstream business-logic gate or calculation; it is recorded purely as a processing audit marker.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to the current timestamp (`now`) each time the scheduler-driven accrual engine successfully increments the balance; provides a processing audit trail.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview for display purposes; not modified during payroll run processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:LastAccrualDate, \"LastAccrualDate\")`, so it is only changed when a non-null value is explicitly supplied to the UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-06-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Used" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Cumulative leave units consumed by the worker through time-off or encashment deductions against this accrual balance.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that Used is not null before the INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Increased by `EncashableBalance` during payroll encashment processing: `Used + EncashableBalance` is written to the PaySlip preview and subsequently persisted.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Used, \"Used\")`, so it is only changed when an explicit non-null value is provided.\n\n**Example:** `7.50`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional free-text description providing context or notes about this specific accrual balance record.\n\nNOTE: This property is not actively used in business logic. It is persisted and available for display or future annotation requirements.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Treated as a sensitive field and redacted to the string `\"Redacted\"` in all tracker audit log entries after a successful INSERT, UPDATE, or DELETE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Passed through as-is to the PaySlip preview; not used in any calculation or business-logic branch.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Description, \"Description\")`, so it is only changed when an explicit non-null value is provided.\n\n**Example:** `Vacation accrual balance.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional end date defining the upper boundary of the validity period for this accrual balance record.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not actively used as a processing gate or filter in business logic. It is persisted, validated on write, and passed through to the PaySlip preview, but no service applies it to restrict balance eligibility.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Validated via `ValidateDates` alongside `EffectiveFromDate`; the validator checks that the new date is a parseable date string and that `EffectiveToDate` is not earlier than `EffectiveFromDate`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview; not used to gate or filter balance processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:EffectiveToDate, \"EffectiveToDate\")`, so it is only changed when an explicit non-null value is provided.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Mandatory start date defining the lower boundary of the validity period for this accrual balance record.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not actively used as a processing gate or filter in business logic. It is persisted, validated on write, and passed through to the PaySlip preview, but no service applies it to restrict balance eligibility.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that EffectiveFromDate is not null before the INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Validated via `ValidateDates` alongside `EffectiveToDate`; the validator checks that the value is a parseable date string and that it is not later than `EffectiveToDate`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview; not used to gate or filter balance processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:EffectiveFromDate, \"EffectiveFromDate\")`, so it is only changed when an explicit non-null value is provided.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccrualName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Denormalized display name of the parent Accrual policy, cached on the balance record to avoid repeated lookups and to preserve a human-readable label for reporting and the PaySlip preview.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from `selectAccrualOutput.Name` (via `ValidateAccrual`) at creation time; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Re-synced conditionally: set to the current policy Name only when it differs from the stored value (`selectAccrualOutput.Name != selectAccrualBalanceOutput.AccrualName`); otherwise left null so the COALESCE in the UPDATE SQL retains the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped to `AccrualBalance.Accrual.Name` in the payroll assembly; later formatted in display (e.g., appending \"Leave Credits\") before appearing on the PaySlip.\n\n**Example:** `Vacation`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CarryOver" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Leave units carried forward from the previous fiscal year into the current period for this worker-accrual pair.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Computed at fiscal year-end as `min(Balance, accrual_CarryForwardLimit)` when `CanCarryForward = 1`; set to 0 when `CanCarryForward = 0`, causing the balance to expire entirely.\n- Written to the balance record via `UpdateAccrualBalance`, after which `Balance` is reset to `0 + CarryOver`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview for display purposes; not modified or consumed in encashment calculations.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:CarryOver, \"CarryOver\")`, so it is only changed when an explicit non-null value is provided.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "MaxBalance" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Denormalized copy of the parent Accrual policy's `MaxAnnualAccrual` limit, cached on the balance record at creation and kept in sync on updates to facilitate cap enforcement without repeated policy lookups.\n\nNOTE: MaxBalance is persisted as a convenience cache for reporting and display. Active cap enforcement during accrual generation reads the live policy value rather than this field.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from `selectAccrualOutput.MaxAnnualAccrual` at creation time; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Re-synced conditionally: set to the current policy value only when it differs from the stored value; otherwise left null so the COALESCE in the UPDATE SQL retains the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- The accrual cap check during scheduler processing uses `accrual_MaxAnnualAccrual` directly from the joined accrual row rather than this cached field, so MaxBalance on the balance record itself is not read during automated processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Mapped as-is to the PaySlip preview for display purposes; not consumed in encashment calculations.\n\n**Example:** `80.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccrualCode" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Denormalized short code of the parent Accrual policy, cached on the balance record to support display, reporting, and PaySlip labeling without requiring a policy join.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from `selectAccrualOutput.Code` at creation time; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Re-synced conditionally: set to the current policy Code only when it differs from the stored value; otherwise left null so the COALESCE in the UPDATE SQL retains the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped to `AccrualBalance.Accrual.Code` during payroll assembly for PaySlip display.\n\n**Example:** `VAC`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccrualId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the Accrual policy record that governs the rules for this balance (rate, cap, carry-forward, encashment policy, etc.).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that AccrualId is not null.\n- Used to call `ValidateAccrual` and derive AccrualName, AccrualCode, and MaxBalance; used to enforce the encashment policy gate (`AllowEncashment`).\n- Duplicate-check via `SelectAccrualBalanceByAccrualAndWorker` prevents creating a second balance for the same `(AccrualId, WorkerId)` pair.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Used as the join key in `SelectAllAccrualBalanceByAccrual` to retrieve all balances governed by a specific accrual policy during scheduler-driven batch processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Used to look up and hydrate the full Accrual sub-model on `AccrualBalance.Accrual` during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EarningId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key referencing the Earning component used for leave encashment; must be non-null if and only if the governing Accrual policy has `AllowEncashment = true`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Enforced by an encashment policy gate: if `AllowEncashment = true` and `EarningId = null`, returns 400 \"EarningId must be provided for cashable accruals.\"; if `AllowEncashment = false` and `EarningId != null`, returns 400 \"EarningId must be null for non-cashable accruals.\".\n- When non-null, `ValidateEarning` is invoked to confirm the referenced Earning record exists.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Passed unchanged into `UpdateAccrualBalance` during automated processing; not modified by scheduler operations.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Used to hydrate the `AccrualBalance.Earning` sub-model (Name, Type, Code, CalculationMethod, Amount, IsTaxable, etc.) required for encashment calculations in `ProcessAccrualBalances`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessAccrualBalances.gloop`]\n- Checked as `Earning.Id != null` to determine whether encashment processing applies for this balance.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the Worker record that owns this accrual balance.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that WorkerId is not null.\n- Used to call `ValidateWorker` to confirm the referenced Worker record exists.\n- Combined with `AccrualId` in `SelectAccrualBalanceByAccrualAndWorker` to enforce the uniqueness constraint (one balance record per worker per accrual policy).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/SelectAllAccrualBalanceByWorker.gloop`]\n- Used as the primary filter to retrieve all accrual balances belonging to a specific worker; the requesting user must either match the worker or be a Payroll Admin.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/ProcessFiscalYearEndAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Used to look up the worker's `EmploymentStartDate` when evaluating `WaitingDays` eligibility before applying an accrual increment.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Used as the filter in `SelectAllAccrualBalanceByWorker` during payroll assembly to load all accrual balances for each worker in the payroll run.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the accrual balance record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the accrual balance record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a balance field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Persisted as part of the INSERT statement alongside `CreatedDate`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the accrual balance record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`); not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`, so it is only changed when a non-null value is explicitly supplied.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the accrual balance record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`); not supplied by the API caller as a balance field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/UpdateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the accrual balance record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/SelectAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where DeletedDate is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the accrual balance record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteAccrualBalanceInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL DELETE (soft-delete update) is executed.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this accrual balance record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/accrual_balance/SelectAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where Deleted is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/DeleteAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Set to true (via the SQL soft-delete UPDATE) when `DeleteAccrualBalance` is invoked; the record is never physically removed from the database.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual_balance/InsertAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 11, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties" : false
      },
