      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Worker" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `WORKER` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT and returned to the service layer via the `RETURNING \"Id\"` clause.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — value is database-generated; the service layer does not supply it on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` is explicitly set to `true`; the generated `Id` is mapped back to the response and then written to `USER.WorkerId` via `UpdateUser`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UserId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The identity of the user account linked to this worker profile.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is currently not persisted to the `WORKER` database table. `UserId` is present in the `Worker.model` and is accepted as a service-layer input by `InsertWorker`, but it is absent from the `WORKER` DDL and is not included in the `InsertWorker` SQL statement. It is used exclusively for pre-INSERT validation and side effects: verifying the referenced user exists, confirming the user has the `Worker` role, enforcing the one-user-to-one-worker exclusivity constraint, and then writing the newly created `Worker.Id` back to `USER.WorkerId` via `UpdateUser`. It is not available as an input to `UpdateWorker`. The planned architecture refactor would add `WORKER.UserId` as a proper database column, inverting ownership of the user-worker relationship.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required as a service-layer input: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Used to call `SelectUser`, validate existence (404 if not found), check `USER.WorkerId == null` (409 if already linked), and verify the `\"Worker\"` role is assigned to this user (via `SelectAllRoleByUser`).\n- After INSERT, the new `Worker.Id` is written to `USER.WorkerId` via direct `UpdateUser` SQL call.\n- Not included in `InsertWorker` SQL; not mapped to any database column.\n\n**Example:** `42`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "OriginalHireDateTime" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date and time the worker was first hired. Required on INSERT. Validated for date format before persistence. Cleared to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `OriginalHireDateTime` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Date format validated via `ValidateDates` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "SeniorityDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date used for seniority calculations, which may differ from `OriginalHireDateTime`. Optional on INSERT. Validated for date format when provided. Cleared to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `SeniorityDate` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Date format validated via `ValidateDates` (included in the date validation list alongside `OriginalHireDateTime` and `BirthDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "BirthDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The worker's date of birth. Optional on INSERT. Validated for date format when provided. Cleared to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `BirthDate` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Date format validated via `ValidateDates`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `NULL` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `1990-01-01 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "IsDisabled" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Indicates whether the worker has a recognised disability. Required on INSERT. Stored as an integer (`1` = true, `0` = false); the service layer converts the boolean input before persisting. Preserved on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `IsDisabled` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Written as `worker.IsDisabled == null ? null : (worker.IsDisabled ? 1 : 0)` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "IsFulltimeStudent" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Indicates whether the worker is a full-time student. Required on INSERT. Stored as an integer (`1` = true, `0` = false); the service layer converts the boolean input before persisting. Preserved on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `IsFulltimeStudent` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Written as `worker.IsFulltimeStudent == null ? null : (worker.IsFulltimeStudent ? 1 : 0)` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "MaritalStatus" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The worker's marital status, used for tax-filing purposes. Required on INSERT. Replaced with a CONCAT placeholder on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `MaritalStatus` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Replaced on soft delete with `CONCAT('Deleted Worker ', Id ,' Marital Status')`.\n\n**Example:** `Single`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "NumberOfDependents" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The number of dependants claimed by the worker for tax withholding calculations. Required on INSERT. Zeroed out on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `NumberOfDependents` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Set to `0` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `2`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerType" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Classifies the worker's employment arrangement (e.g., full-time, part-time, contractor). Required on INSERT. Preserved on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `WorkerType` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `Full-Time`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerStatus" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The current employment status of the worker (e.g., active, on leave, terminated). Optional on INSERT. Preserved on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `WorkerStatus` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `Active`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorksFromHome" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Indicates whether the worker primarily works from a home location, which may affect tax jurisdiction and compliance rules. Optional on INSERT. Stored as an integer (`1` = true, `0` = false); the service layer converts the boolean input before persisting. Preserved on soft delete.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is persisted from service input but is not currently evaluated by any downstream payroll processing logic. `WorksFromHome` is stored via `InsertWorker` and `UpdateWorker` and is returned in API read responses, but no payroll run service reads or evaluates this field in any fork condition, expression, or calculation step. It is propagated through worker profile result sets for informational purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Written as `worker.WorksFromHome == null ? null : (worker.WorksFromHome ? 1 : 0)` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CompanyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the company this worker belongs to. Required on INSERT. Not modifiable after creation — `CompanyId` is absent from the `UpdateWorker` service input model, making it effectively immutable post-INSERT through the service layer.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `companyid_worker_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"CompanyId\") REFERENCES \"COMPANY\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Company existence validated via `ValidateCompany` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Present in the UPDATE SQL with `COALESCE`, but never supplied by the `UpdateWorker` service (absent from service input model), so the value is always preserved unchanged via `COALESCE(null, \"CompanyId\")`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the currency used for this worker's pay calculations. Required on INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `currencyid_worker_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"CurrencyId\") REFERENCES \"CURRENCY\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Currency existence validated via `ValidateCurrency` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CountryId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the worker's country of employment. Required on INSERT. Used together with `StateId` for geographic tax applicability lookups.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `countryid_worker_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"CountryId\") REFERENCES \"COUNTRY\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Country and state combination validated via `ValidateCountryAndState` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "StateId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the worker's state of employment. Optional — when null, only country-level tax applicability applies. Validated against `CountryId` when provided.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `stateid_worker_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"StateId\") REFERENCES \"STATE\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- When provided, validated as part of `ValidateCountryAndState`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses **direct assignment** on UPDATE (`\"StateId\" = :StateId`), not `COALESCE`. Passing `null` will explicitly clear `StateId`, reverting the worker to a country-only jurisdiction.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the worker record was first created. Set automatically by the service layer on INSERT and not modifiable through the update flow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who created this worker record. Captured from the authenticated `UserId` at the time of INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Mapped from the authenticated `UserId` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input directly.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp of the most recent write to the worker record. Set automatically on INSERT and updated on every subsequent modification.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE; updated by passing the current timestamp from the service layer.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who last modified this worker record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/InsertWorker.gloop`]\n- Mapped from the authenticated `UserId` on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/UpdateWorker.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the worker record was soft-deleted. Null for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Set to the deletion timestamp when a soft delete is performed.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who performed the soft delete. Null for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Set via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "The soft-delete flag for this record. `0` (false) indicates an active worker; `1` (true) indicates the record has been soft-deleted and is excluded from standard queries.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker/DeleteWorker.gloop`]\n- Set to `1` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
