          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the attendance summary record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/InsertAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the CSV or the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/attendance_summary/InsertAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 19, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who triggered the import that created this attendance summary record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/InsertAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the import service; not supplied from the CSV.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/attendance_summary/InsertAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Persisted alongside `CreatedDate` in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 19, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
