            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the attendance summary record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/DeleteAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/attendance_summary/SelectAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where DeletedDate is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 19, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the attendance summary record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/DeleteAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteAttendanceSummaryInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/attendance_summary/DeleteAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 19, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
