            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this attendance summary record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/attendance_summary/SelectAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where Deleted is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/DeleteAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1 in the database) via the SQL soft-delete UPDATE when `DeleteAttendanceSummary` is invoked; the record is never physically removed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/attendance_summary/InsertAttendanceSummary.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 19, 2026",
