      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Bank_Info" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the bank info record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Checked alongside `updateCount > 0` to confirm the record was created before logging to the tracker and returning the API response.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from the lookup produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteAllBankInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n- Collected into a `BankInfoIds` array via `SelectAllBankInfoByWorker` and iterated to drive per-record `DeleteBankInfo` calls; successfully deleted IDs are returned in `bankInfoIdsDeleted`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "BankName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The name of the financial institution where the worker holds the account.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `BankName` is not null before the INSERT proceeds.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, replaces the existing value via `COALESCE(:BankName, \"BankName\")`. When omitted (null), the existing value is preserved.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Bank Info {Id} Bank Name'`, permanently obscuring the original value at the storage level.\n\n**Example:** `First National Bank`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccountNumber" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The worker's bank account number used for payroll disbursement.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `AccountNumber` is not null before the INSERT proceeds.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, replaces the existing value via `COALESCE`. When omitted, the existing value is preserved.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Bank Info {Id} Account Number'`.\n\n**Example:** `1234567890`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "RoutingNumber" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The bank routing number that identifies the financial institution for electronic fund transfers.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; not included in the `ValidateRequiredFields` check, so a record may be created without a routing number.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, replaces the existing value via `COALESCE`. When omitted, the existing value is preserved.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Bank Info {Id} RoutingNumber'`.\n\n**Example:** `021000021`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "AccountType" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The type of bank account, typically indicating how funds are held or accessed (e.g., \"CHECKING\", \"SAVINGS\").\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `AccountType` is not null before the INSERT proceeds.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n- No enumerated choices are defined at the model level; the application does not currently enforce a fixed set of allowed values at the service or database layer.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, replaces the existing value via `COALESCE`. When omitted, the existing value is preserved.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Bank Info {Id} AccountType'`.\n\n**Example:** `Checking`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the Worker record that owns this bank account. Enforces the one-to-one relationship between a worker and their bank info at the service layer.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `WorkerId` is not null.\n- Used to call `ValidateWorker` to confirm the referenced Worker record exists before any further processing.\n- Used to perform the pre-insert duplicate check via `SelectBankInfoByWorker`; if an active record already exists for this worker, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/SelectBankInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/SelectBankInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n- Used as the sole filter in `SelectBankInfoByWorker` to retrieve the single active bank info record for a given worker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteAllBankInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n- Used as the filter in `SelectAllBankInfoByWorker` to collect all active bank info IDs for a worker before bulk soft-deletion.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Present in the UPDATE SQL via `COALESCE(:WorkerId, \"WorkerId\")`; however, the `UpdateBankInfo` service layer never supplies `WorkerId` to the SQL call, so it is effectively immutable after creation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Enforced at the database level by the foreign key constraint `workerid_bank_info_fkey`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the bank info record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the bank info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a data field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted alongside `CreatedDate` in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the bank info record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`); not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`, so it is only changed when a non-null value is explicitly supplied.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the bank info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/UpdateBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the bank info record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/SelectBankInfo.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the bank info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteBankInfoInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this bank info record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/SelectBankInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/bank_info/SelectBankInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/DeleteBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1 in the database) via the SQL soft-delete UPDATE when `DeleteBankInfo` is invoked; the record is never physically removed.\n- In addition to setting this flag, the SQL soft-delete simultaneously overwrites all four data fields (`BankName`, `AccountNumber`, `RoutingNumber`, `AccountType`) with obfuscated placeholder strings.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/bank_info/InsertBankInfo.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties" : false
      },
