      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Benefit" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the benefit record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before returning the API response and logging to the tracker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Passed to `SelectPositionPayComponentCountByBenefit` and `SelectWorkerPayComponentCountByBenefit` to validate that no downstream assignment records reference this benefit before soft-deletion proceeds.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Human-readable display name for the benefit.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Name` is not null before the INSERT proceeds.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, replaces the existing value via `COALESCE(:Name, \"Name\")`. When omitted (null), the existing value is preserved.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Benefit {Id} Name'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- Surfaced on `EarningLogs` and `DeductionLogs` entries in the PaySlip preview for display.\n\n**Example:** `Health Insurance`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "ProviderName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Name of the external provider administering this benefit.\n\nNOTE: This field is informational only. There is no system-level integration with external providers; the value is stored purely for reference.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `ProviderName` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Benefit {Id} Provider Name'`.\n\n**Example:** `BlueCross BlueShield`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Type" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Tax timing classification for the benefit. Allowed values: `PRETAX`, `POSTTAX`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Type` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- Consumed during payroll processing alongside `Action` to route the calculated `EmployeeAmount`:\n    - `Action = EARNING, Type = PRETAX`: Tax applicability (`IsTaxable`) is evaluated; amount is split between `GrossTaxable` / `GrossNonTaxable` based on `TaxExemptionAmount`.\n    - `Action = EARNING, Type = POSTTAX`: Amount is added to `GrossNonTaxable` when `IsTaxable = false`.\n    - `Action = DEDUCTION, Type = PRETAX`: Amount is added to `PreTaxDeductions` and subtracted from `NetTaxable` (reduces taxable income).\n    - `Action = DEDUCTION, Type = POSTTAX`: Amount is added to `PostTaxDeductions` (does not affect taxable income).\n\nNOTE: The application of `PRETAX`/`POSTTAX` logic to `Action = EARNING` benefits is under review; current implementation indicates it may be redundant for earnings and primarily applicable to deductions.\n\n**Example:** `PRETAX`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true,
            "enum" : [ "PRETAX", "POSTTAX" ]
          },
          "Code" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Short unique identifier code for the benefit used for display and referencing purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Code` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Benefit {Id} Code'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- Surfaced on `EarningLogs` and `DeductionLogs` entries in the PaySlip preview for display.\n\n**Example:** `HLTH`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional free-text description providing additional context about the benefit beyond its name.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Benefit {Id} Description'`.\n\n**Example:** `Employee health insurance benefit.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the benefit is currently active and available for assignment and payroll processing. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. No payroll processing logic uses `Active` to gate or activate a benefit at runtime.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Active` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `benefit.Active == null ? null : (benefit.Active ? 1 : 0)`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/benefit/DeleteBenefit.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `0` (false) by the soft-delete SQL, in addition to setting `Deleted = 1`.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which the benefit policy takes effect, defining the start of the benefit's active window.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. No payroll processing logic uses `EffectiveFromDate` to gate or activate a benefit at runtime.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EffectiveFromDate` is not null.\n- Validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` (format-only check, no range check on insert).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`, which also compares against the existing `EffectiveToDate` (and the new `EffectiveToDate` if provided) to ensure `EffectiveFromDate` is not after `EffectiveToDate`.\n- Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional end date defining when the benefit policy expires. Null indicates no expiry.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. No payroll processing logic uses `EffectiveToDate` to expire or deactivate a benefit at runtime.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided (format-only, no range check on insert).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`.\n- Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
