            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `CalculationMethod` record that defines how the employee's benefit amount is computed (e.g., `FLAT` or `PERCENT` of pay period rate).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmployeeCalculationMethodId` is not null.\n- Validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod` to confirm the referenced record exists.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod` before the UPDATE proceeds.\n- Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- Resolved at payroll run time via `SelectCalculationMethod` to retrieve the `Method` field. When `Method = PERCENT`, `EmployeeAmount` is multiplied by the position's `PayPeriodRate`; when `Method = FLAT`, `EmployeeAmount` is used directly.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
