          "EmployeeAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The base employee-side amount for this benefit, interpreted according to `EmployeeCalculationMethodId` (flat monetary value for `FLAT`, multiplier for `PERCENT`).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmployeeAmount` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- At payroll run time, the effective employee amount is resolved as `CustomEmployeeAmount ?: EmployeeAmount` (worker-level override takes precedence if set).\n- When `EmployeeCalculationMethod.Method = PERCENT`, the effective amount is further multiplied by the position's `PayPeriodRate`.\n- The final amount is then clamped between `EmployeePayPeriodMin` and `EmployeePayPeriodMax` via `ClampAmount` before being applied to payslip totals.\n\n**Example:** `150.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
