            "description" : "The minimum employee-side amount that must be applied in a single pay period. Acts as a lower clamp on the calculated `EmployeeAmount` during payroll processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- Passed as `minLimit` to `ClampAmount` after the employee amount is calculated. If the calculated amount falls below this value, it is raised to `EmployeePayPeriodMin`.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
