          "Action" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Determines whether this benefit increases or decreases a worker's pay. Allowed values: `EARNING`, `DEDUCTION`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Action` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- The primary branching key in payroll processing:\n    - `EARNING`: `EmployeeAmount` is added to `GrossPay`; tax handling is applied based on `Type` and `IsTaxable`; the result is logged to `EarningLogs`.\n    - `DEDUCTION`: `EmployeeAmount` is added to `TotalDeductions` and `TotalEmployeeBenefitDeduction`; `Type = PRETAX` further reduces `NetTaxable` via `PreTaxDeductions`; `Type = POSTTAX` writes to `PostTaxDeductions`; the result is logged to `DeductionLogs`.\n\nNOTE: This field is the architectural foundation of the dual-purpose design. When the planned entity separation occurs, `Action = EARNING` records will migrate to the `Earning` entity and `Action = DEDUCTION` records will migrate to the `Deduction` entity.\n\n**Example:** `DEDUCTION`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
            "nullable" : true,
            "enum" : [ "EARNING", "DEDUCTION" ]
          },
          "CoverageAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The coverage or insured value associated with this benefit.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It does not affect payroll calculations and is stored for reference and display purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE; no validation is applied beyond storage.\n\n**Example:** `10000.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
