          "EmployerAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The base employer-side contribution amount for this benefit, interpreted according to `EmployerCalculationMethodId`. Only meaningful and required when `EmployerContribution = true`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/InsertBenefit.gloop`]\n- Conditionally required: when `EmployerContribution = true`, `ValidateDependentAttributes` enforces that `EmployerAmount` is not null alongside `EmployerCalculationMethodId`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/benefit/UpdateBenefit.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`. Validated as part of the `EmployerContribution` dependent attribute check.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessBenefits.gloop`]\n- At payroll run time (when `EmployerContribution = true`), the effective employer amount is resolved as `CustomEmployerAmount ?: EmployerAmount` (worker-level override takes precedence).\n- When `EmployerCalculationMethod.Method = PERCENT`, the effective amount is multiplied by the position's `PayPeriodRate`.\n- Clamped between `EmployerPayPeriodMin` and `EmployerPayPeriodMax` via `ClampAmount` before accumulation into `TotalEmployerBenefitContribution`.\n\n**Example:** `250.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 20, 2026",
