      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Currency" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the currency record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before returning the API response and logging to the tracker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from `SelectCurrency` produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Used in the name-uniqueness check: if `SelectCurrencyByName` returns a record with a different Id than the one being updated, a 409 Conflict is returned to prevent a duplicate name.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/ValidateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Passed as `CurrencyId` to `SelectCurrency`; a null result throws an exception re-raised as 404, blocking any service that requires a valid currency reference.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Used within the soft-delete SQL `CONCAT` expressions to generate placeholder strings for anonymized fields (e.g., `'Deleted Currency {Id} Name'`).\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the currency is currently active and available for use. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nNOTE: This property is not currently used as a processing gate in any payroll run or pay component logic. `ValidateCurrency` filters only on `Deleted = 0`, not on `Active`. It is persisted for administrative visibility and future enforcement.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Active` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `currency.Active == null ? null : (currency.Active ? 1 : 0)`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`. Only editable on custom records.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The display name of the currency (e.g., \"US Dollar\", \"Philippine Peso\"). Must be unique across all active currency records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `CurrencyName` is not null.\n- Before INSERT, `SelectCurrencyByName` is called: if an active record with the same name exists, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, `SelectCurrencyByName` is called to check for conflicts with other records. A match against a different Id returns 409 Conflict.\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:CurrencyName, \"CurrencyName\")`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n- Only editable on custom records (`Custom = 1`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Currency {Id} Name'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllEarningAndBenefitByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Hydrated from `SelectCurrency` into the currency sub-model of pay components during payroll assembly. Carried through to `EarningLogs` and `DeductionLogs` entries in the PaySlip preview for display.\n\n**Example:** `US Dollar`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencySymbol" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The display symbol for the currency (e.g., `\"$\"`, `\"₱\"`, `\"€\"`).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `CurrencySymbol` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n- Only editable on custom records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Currency {Id} Symbol'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllEarningAndBenefitByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Hydrated into the currency sub-model of pay components during payroll assembly; carried through to PaySlip log entries for display.\n\n**Example:** `$`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "IsoCurrencyCode" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The ISO 4217 currency code (or custom equivalent) for the currency (e.g., `\"USD\"`, `\"PHP\"`, `\"EUR\"`).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `IsoCurrencyCode` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n- Only editable on custom records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Currency {Id} ISO Code'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllEarningAndBenefitByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Hydrated into the currency sub-model of pay components during payroll assembly; carried through to PaySlip log entries for display.\n\n**Example:** `USD`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyPrecision" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The number of decimal places used when displaying or formatting monetary values in this currency (e.g., `2` for USD, `0` for PHP).\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not used in any monetary arithmetic or rounding logic. It is persisted and passed through as a display metadata field, reserved for future use when currency-aware formatting of payroll amounts is implemented.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `CurrencyPrecision` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`. Only editable on custom records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Explicitly preserved on soft-delete (the `CurrencyPrecision` overwrite is commented out in the SQL), ensuring the value remains available for reference after deletion.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllEarningAndBenefitByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Hydrated into the currency sub-model of pay components during payroll assembly; carried through to PaySlip log entries for display.\n\n**Example:** `2`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Custom" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag distinguishing user-created custom currency records from system-seeded records. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = custom, 0 = system).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Not supplied by the API caller; set automatically by the database schema default to 1 for all records created through the service layer. System-seeded records with `Custom = 0` are inserted only during database initialization.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Read from the existing record after `SelectCurrency`: if `selectCurrencyOutput.Custom == 0` (system record), returns 403 Forbidden with \"Editing system entities is not allowed.\" before any further processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Read from the existing record after `SelectCurrency`: if `selectCurrencyOutput.Custom == 0` (system record), returns 403 Forbidden with \"Deleting system entities is not allowed.\" before any further processing.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the currency record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\nNOTE: For system-seeded records (`Custom = 0`), this field is set at database initialization time rather than through the service layer.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the currency record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a currency field.\n\nNOTE: For system-seeded records (`Custom = 0`), this field reflects the database initialization context rather than a service-layer caller.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the currency record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the currency record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/UpdateCurrency.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the currency record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n- Only reachable for custom records (`Custom = 1`); system records are blocked with 403 Forbidden before this point.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/SelectCurrency.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the currency record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteCurrencyInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this currency record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/currency/SelectCurrency.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/DeleteCurrency.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1) via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same SQL statement also overwrites `CurrencyName`, `CurrencySymbol`, and `IsoCurrencyCode` with obfuscated placeholder strings, while `CurrencyPrecision` is preserved. The record is never physically removed.\n- Only reachable for custom records (`Custom = 1`); system records are blocked with 403 Forbidden before the soft-delete is attempted.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/currency/InsertCurrency.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties" : false
      },
