      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Country" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the country record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before returning the API response and logging to the tracker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from `SelectCountry` produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Used in the name-uniqueness check: if `SelectCountryByName` returns a record with a different Id than the one being updated, a 409 Conflict is returned to prevent a duplicate name.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Used within the soft-delete SQL `CONCAT` expressions to generate placeholder strings for anonymized fields (e.g., `'Deleted Country {Id} Name'`).\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The display name of the country (e.g., \"United States\", \"Philippines\"). Must be unique across all active country records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Name` is not null.\n- Before INSERT, `SelectCountryByName` is called: if an active record with the same name already exists, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, `SelectCountryByName` is called to check for conflicts with other records. A match against a different Id returns 409 Conflict.\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Name, \"Name\")`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n- Only editable on custom records (`Custom = 1`); attempting to update a system record returns 403 Forbidden before this field is processed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Country {Id} Name'`.\n\n**Example:** `United States`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TimeZone" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The primary time zone identifier for the country (e.g., `\"America/New_York\"`, `\"Asia/Manila\"`). Used for geographic reference.\n\nNOTE: This field is not currently consumed by any payroll calculation or scheduling logic. It is persisted for geographic reference and future time-zone-aware processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `TimeZone` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n- Only editable on custom records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Country {Id} Time Zone'`.\n\n**Example:** `America/New_York`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WithStates" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether this country is expected to have sub-national state or province records associated with it. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `WithStates` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `country.WithStates == null ? null : (country.WithStates ? 1 : 0)`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Changing from `true` to `false` is blocked when active `State` records reference the country: `SelectStateCountByCountry` is checked first, and if `stateCount > 0`, a 409 Conflict is returned with the message \"Cannot change 'WithStates' to false because the country has states associated with it.\"\n- Only editable on custom records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/ValidateCountryAndState.gloop`]\n- Branched on to enforce state requirement rules:\n    - `WithStates = 1` and `StateId` provided: the state is looked up via `SelectStateByCountry` and must belong to this country; null result returns 404.\n    - `WithStates = 1` and `StateId` is null: returns 400 \"The selected country requires a state.\"\n    - `WithStates = 0` and `StateId` provided: returns 400 \"The selected country does not support states.\"\n    - `WithStates = 0` and `StateId` is null: passes validation with no further checks.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Custom" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag distinguishing user-created custom country records from system-seeded records. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = custom, 0 = system).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Not supplied by the API caller; set automatically by the database schema default to 1 for all records created through the service layer. System-seeded records with `Custom = 0` are inserted only during database initialization.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Read from the existing record after `SelectCountry`: if `selectCountryOutput.Custom == 0` (system record), returns 403 Forbidden with \"Editing system entities is not allowed.\" before any further processing.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Read from the existing record after `SelectCountry`: if `selectCountryOutput.Custom == 0` (system record), returns 403 Forbidden with \"Deleting system entities is not allowed.\" before any further processing.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the country record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\nNOTE: For system-seeded records (`Custom = 0`), this field is set at database initialization time rather than through the service layer.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the country record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a country field.\n\nNOTE: For system-seeded records (`Custom = 0`), this field reflects the database initialization context rather than a service-layer caller.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the country record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the country record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/UpdateCountry.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the country record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n- Only reachable for custom records (`Custom = 1`); system records are blocked before this point.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/SelectCountry.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the country record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteCountryInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this country record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/country/SelectCountry.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/DeleteCountry.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1) via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same SQL statement also overwrites `Name` and `TimeZone` with obfuscated placeholder strings. The record is never physically removed.\n- Only reachable for custom records (`Custom = 1`); system records are blocked with 403 Forbidden before the soft-delete is attempted.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/country/InsertCountry.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
