      "lonti_app_payroll_model_State" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The system-generated primary key for the state record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` in the `STATE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Retrieved on INSERT via `$getGeneratedKeys = true`. The generated value is mapped back to the service response.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The name of the state or province (e.g., `'California'`, `'Ontario'`). Must be unique within the parent country.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL` in the `STATE` DDL.\n- `CONSTRAINT \"STATE_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Name\", \"CountryId\")` enforces uniqueness at the database level.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. Validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Application-level uniqueness pre-check is performed before INSERT; returns a validation error if a state with the same name already exists in the country.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/UpdateState.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n- Uniqueness is re-validated within the country scope during update.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/DeleteState.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `CONCAT('Deleted State ', \"Id\", ' Name')` on soft-delete to free the unique name slot.\n\n**Example:** `California`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TimeZone" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The IANA timezone identifier for the state (e.g., `'America/Los_Angeles'`). Used for time-sensitive payroll calculations and scheduling.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL` in the `STATE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. Validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/UpdateState.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/DeleteState.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `CONCAT('Deleted State ', \"Id\", ' Time Zone')` on soft-delete.\n\n**Example:** `America/Los_Angeles`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CountryId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key to the `COUNTRY` table. Identifies the country to which this state belongs. The referenced country must have `WithStates = true` for state records to be created under it.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER NOT NULL` in the `STATE` DDL.\n- FK constraint `countryid_state_fkey`: references `COUNTRY(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. Validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`. The service also validates that the referenced country exists and that `Country.WithStates = true` before proceeding.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/UpdateState.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. When a new `CountryId` is provided, the service re-validates that the new country exists and has `WithStates = true`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Custom" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Distinguishes system-seeded state records (`0`) from user-created records (`1`). Records with `Custom = 0` are protected from modification and deletion by the `UpdateState` and `DeleteState` services.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER DEFAULT 1` in the `STATE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- `Custom` is not included in the INSERT SQL. All records created through the service receive `Custom = 1` via the database column default.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/UpdateState.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/DeleteState.gloop`]\n- Both services check `Custom = 1` before proceeding. Requests targeting records with `Custom = 0` are rejected.\n\n**NOTE:** `Custom` is not included in the `UpdateState` SQL and is therefore immutable after INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when this state record was created.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `STATE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` at INSERT time by the service. Not provided by the caller.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created this state record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Mapped from the `UserId` service input at INSERT time.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording the most recent modification to this record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `STATE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/state/InsertState.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` at INSERT time by the service.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/state/UpdateState.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. The `UpdateState` service maps `UserId` to `UpdatedBy` and sets `UpdatedDate` to `now`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
