      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Deduction" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the deduction record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before returning the API response and logging to the tracker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from `SelectDeduction` produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Used in the name-uniqueness conflict check: if `SelectDeductionByName` returns a record with a different Id than the one being updated, a 409 Conflict is returned.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteAllDeductionByWorker.gloop`]\n- Collected into a `DeductionIds` array via `SelectAllDeductionByWorker` and iterated to drive per-record `DeleteDeduction` calls; successfully deleted Ids are returned in `deductionIdsDeleted`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Used within the soft-delete SQL `CONCAT` expressions to generate placeholder strings for anonymized fields (e.g., `'Deleted Deduction {Id} Name'`).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Human-readable display name for the deduction. Must be unique across all active deduction records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Name` is not null.\n- Before INSERT, `SelectDeductionByName` is called: if an active record with the same name exists, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, `SelectDeductionByName` is called to check for conflicts with other records. A match against a different Id returns 409 Conflict.\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Name, \"Name\")`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Deduction {Id} Name'`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Code" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Short unique identifier code for the deduction used for display and referencing purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Code` is not null.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Deduction {Id} Code'`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Type" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Tax timing classification for the deduction. Allowed values: `PRETAX`, `POSTTAX`.\n\n- **`PRETAX`**: The deduction occurs before tax calculation, reducing the worker's taxable income.\n- **`POSTTAX`**: The deduction occurs after tax calculation, reducing the worker's net pay without affecting taxable income.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Type` is not null.\n- Updated via `COALESCE` on update; preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\nNOTE: `ProcessDeductions` exists in the codebase and branches on `Type` using the same `PRETAX`/`POSTTAX` routing as `ProcessBenefits`, but is not currently active in payroll runs. See the top-level model comment for architectural context.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true,
            "enum" : [ "PRETAX", "POSTTAX" ]
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional free-text description providing additional context about the deduction.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Overwritten in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Deduction {Id} Description'`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the deduction is currently active. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `Active` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `deduction.Active == null ? null : (deduction.Active ? 1 : 0)`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `0` (false) by the soft-delete SQL, in addition to setting `Deleted = 1`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which this deduction takes effect, defining the start of its active window.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not used as a processing gate since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EffectiveFromDate` is not null.\n- Validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` (format-only on insert).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`, which compares against the existing and new `EffectiveToDate`.\n- Updated via `COALESCE`; preserved on soft-delete.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional end date defining when the deduction expires. Null indicates no expiry.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not used as a processing gate since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`.\n- Updated via `COALESCE`; preserved on soft-delete.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Priority" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Processing priority order for this deduction relative to other deductions on the same worker. Lower values indicate higher priority. Intended to control the sequence in which multiple deductions are applied when funds are limited.\n\nNOTE: This field is a loan-specific feature absent from the `Benefit` entity. It has no active enforcement logic in the current codebase since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Goal" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The total target monetary amount to be collected over the full life of this deduction (e.g., the total loan principal). Once the cumulative amount deducted reaches this value, the deduction is considered complete.\n\nNOTE: This field is a loan-specific feature absent from the `Benefit` entity. It has no active enforcement logic in the current codebase since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Times" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The number of pay periods over which this deduction is applied (e.g., 12 for a 12-instalment loan). Together with `Goal`, enables the system to track deduction completion.\n\nNOTE: This field is a loan-specific feature absent from the `Benefit` entity. It has no active enforcement logic in the current codebase since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Frequency" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Informational label describing how often this deduction is applied (e.g., \"MONTHLY\", \"BIWEEKLY\").\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not consumed by any payroll processing logic. It is stored for reference and display purposes only.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployerContribution" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the employer also contributes to this deduction (e.g., employer matching for retirement). When true, `EmployerCalculationMethodId` and `EmployerContributionAmount` become required. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmployerContribution` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `deduction.EmployerContribution == null ? null : (deduction.EmployerContribution ? 1 : 0)`.\n- Acts as the parent dependency in `ValidateDependentAttributes`: when true, `EmployerCalculationMethodId` and `EmployerContributionAmount` are both required; if either is missing, a 400 error is returned.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Validated against both new and existing values via dual-state `ValidateDependentAttributes`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployeeDeductionAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The base employee-side amount to be deducted per pay period, interpreted according to `EmployeeCalculationMethodId` (flat monetary value for `FLAT`, multiplier for `PERCENT`).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmployeeDeductionAmount` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployerContributionAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The base employer-side contribution amount per pay period, interpreted according to `EmployerCalculationMethodId`. Only required and meaningful when `EmployerContribution = true`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Conditionally required: when `EmployerContribution = true`, `ValidateDependentAttributes` enforces that `EmployerContributionAmount` is not null alongside `EmployerCalculationMethodId`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`. Validated as part of the `EmployerContribution` dependent attribute check.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployeeCalculationMethodId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `CalculationMethod` record that defines how the employee deduction amount is computed (`FLAT` or `PERCENT` of pay period rate).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmployeeCalculationMethodId` is not null.\n- Validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod` to confirm the referenced record exists.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when supplied, validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod`. Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployerCalculationMethodId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `CalculationMethod` record that defines how the employer contribution amount is computed. Only required and meaningful when `EmployerContribution = true`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Conditionally required: when `EmployerContribution = true`, `ValidateDependentAttributes` enforces that this field is not null alongside `EmployerContributionAmount`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`. Validated as part of the `EmployerContribution` dependent attribute check.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployeeAnnualMax" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The maximum annual employee-side deduction amount allowed under this deduction record.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. No active enforcement logic caps annual employee deductions since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployerAnnualMax" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The maximum annual employer-side contribution amount allowed under this deduction record. Only meaningful when `EmployerContribution = true`.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. No active enforcement logic caps annual employer contributions since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodMin" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The minimum employee-side amount that must be deducted in a single pay period. Intended to act as a lower clamp on the calculated deduction amount.\n\nNOTE: This property has no active enforcement logic since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodMax" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The maximum employee-side amount that may be deducted in a single pay period. Intended to act as an upper clamp on the calculated deduction amount.\n\nNOTE: This property has no active enforcement logic since `ProcessDeductions` is inactive.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE.\n- Preserved on soft-delete (commented out in SQL).\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key referencing the `Currency` record that denominates the deduction amounts.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation against the `Currency` table is applied at the service layer.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `Worker` record that owns this deduction. Unlike `Benefit` (which is company-scoped), each deduction is directly tied to a specific worker, making it a per-worker record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `WorkerId` is not null.\n- Validated via `ValidateWorker` to confirm the referenced worker record exists.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteAllDeductionByWorker.gloop`]\n- Used as the filter in `SelectAllDeductionByWorker` to collect all active deduction IDs for a given worker before iterating `DeleteDeduction` for each.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Not supplied by the `UpdateDeduction` service layer; effectively immutable post-creation via the COALESCE pattern.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the deduction record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the deduction record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as a deduction field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Persisted alongside `CreatedDate` in the INSERT statement.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the deduction record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the deduction record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/UpdateDeduction.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the deduction record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/SelectDeduction.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the deduction record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteDeductionInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this deduction record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/deduction/SelectDeduction.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/DeleteDeduction.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1) via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same SQL statement also sets `Active = 0` and overwrites `Name`, `Code`, and `Description` with obfuscated placeholder strings. The record is never physically removed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/deduction/InsertDeduction.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 23, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties" : false
      },
