      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Employment_Info" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the employment info record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n- Confirmed alongside `updateCount > 0` before returning the API response and logging to the tracker.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check; a null result from `SelectEmploymentInfo` produces a 404 \"record not found\" response before any DML is executed.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmploymentStartDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date the worker's employment began under the current employment arrangement.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EmploymentStartDate` is not null.\n- Validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` alongside the other date fields on insert (format-only, no range check).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates` when provided. Updated via `COALESCE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/accrual/GenerateAccrualBalance.gloop`]\n- Used to compute accrual eligibility when an `Accrual` policy has a `WaitingDays` value: `addDays(EmploymentStartDate, WaitingDays)` produces `WorkerAccrualStartDate`. If the current date is before `WorkerAccrualStartDate`, the accrual balance increment is skipped for that worker in that cycle.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmploymentEndDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date the worker's employment is expected to end or has ended under the current employment arrangement. Distinct from `TerminationDate`, which records the formal termination event.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It is persisted and loaded into the payroll assembly model during payroll runs, but no processing or calculation logic currently consumes it downstream.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; validated for format when provided. Updated via `COALESCE`. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "RegulatoryEstablishment" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The regulatory or legal establishment identifier associated with the worker's employment, used for compliance and reporting purposes.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It is persisted for compliance reference but is not consumed by any payroll processing or calculation logic.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; no validation beyond storage.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Employment Info {Id} Regulatory Establishment'`.\n\n**Example:** `San Francisco Office`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FirstDay" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The worker's actual first working day, which may differ from `EmploymentStartDate` in cases where the contract start and the first day of work are not the same.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It is persisted and loaded into the payroll assembly model during payroll runs, but no processing or calculation logic currently consumes it downstream.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional; persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. No validation is applied beyond storage. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `2020-01-15`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "LastDateWorked" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The last date the worker was actively working, populated when a worker stops working prior to formal termination (e.g., during a notice period or administrative leave).\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It is persisted and loaded into the payroll assembly model during payroll runs, but no processing or calculation logic currently consumes it downstream.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided. Persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TerminationReason" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "A description or code explaining why the worker's employment was terminated (e.g., \"Resignation\", \"End of Contract\", \"Redundancy\").\n\nNOTE: This property is currently informational only. It is persisted and loaded into the payroll assembly model during payroll runs, but no processing or calculation logic currently consumes it downstream.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; no validation beyond storage.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful DELETE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Employment Info {Id} Termination Reason'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TerminationDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The formal date on which the worker's employment was terminated. Used by payroll runs to identify terminating workers eligible for final-pay processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided. Persisted on INSERT and updated via `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ReviewPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- `SelectAllFinalPayEligibleWorkerAndPositionByPayPeriod` filters workers whose `TerminationDate` falls within the current pay period window, in conjunction with `FinalPayEligible = true`, to determine which terminating workers are included in the final-pay payroll run.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which this employment info record takes effect, defining the start of the validity window for this employment arrangement.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not used as a processing gate in business logic. It is persisted, validated on write, and loaded into the payroll assembly model, but no service applies it to filter or restrict processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `EffectiveFromDate` is not null.\n- Validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` on insert.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`, comparing against the existing `EffectiveToDate` and new `EffectiveToDate` to ensure `EffectiveFromDate` is not after `EffectiveToDate`. Updated via `COALESCE`. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Optional end date defining when this employment info record expires. Null indicates the record is open-ended.\n\nNOTE: This property is currently not used as a processing gate in business logic. It is persisted, validated on write, and loaded into the payroll assembly model, but no service applies it to filter or restrict processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on creation; validated for date string format via `ValidateDates` when provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; when provided, validated for both format and date range via `ValidateDates`. Updated via `COALESCE`. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "OtherProjectedTaxableIncome" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Additional projected taxable income from sources outside the payroll system that should be factored into the worker's annual tax projection.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `OtherProjectedTaxableIncome` is not null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; updated via `COALESCE`. Preserved on soft-delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessTaxes.gloop`]\n- Added to the running annual taxable total during tax calculation: `ActualRunningAnnualTaxable + (OtherProjectedTaxableIncome ?: 0)`. The Elvis operator `?: 0` ensures a null value is treated as zero, so the field has no effect when not set.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly, making it available to `ProcessTaxes`.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FinalPayEligible" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether this worker is eligible to receive a final pay disbursement in a termination payroll run. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false). When set to true, `FinalPayEligibleDate` is automatically set to the current timestamp.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `FinalPayEligible` is not null.\n- Converted to integer before INSERT: `employmentinfo.FinalPayEligible == null ? null : (employmentinfo.FinalPayEligible ? 1 : 0)`.\n- When `FinalPayEligible = true`, `FinalPayEligibleDate` is automatically set to `now` in the same INSERT statement.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Optional on update; converted to integer and updated via `COALESCE`.\n- When `FinalPayEligible = true`, `FinalPayEligibleDate` is automatically set to `now` in the UPDATE. When `FinalPayEligible = false` or null, `FinalPayEligibleDate` is set to null.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ReviewPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Used by `SelectAllFinalPayEligibleWorkerAndPositionByPayPeriod` to include workers in final-pay payroll runs when `FinalPayEligible = true` and their `TerminationDate` falls within the pay period.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FinalPayEligibleDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp recording when `FinalPayEligible` was set to true. Automatically managed by the service layer — not supplied by the API caller.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` when `FinalPayEligible = true` is provided on INSERT; set to null otherwise. Expression: `employmentinfo.FinalPayEligible == true ? \"now\" : null`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` when `FinalPayEligible = true` on UPDATE; set to null when `FinalPayEligible = false` or null. Same expression applied via COALESCE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ReviewPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the payroll review model alongside `FinalPayEligible` for final-pay worker selection.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/FindPotentialPayrollIssues.gloop`]\n- Read to identify potential issues with final-pay timing and eligibility.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FinalPayProcessed" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Boolean flag indicating whether the worker's final pay has already been disbursed through a payroll run. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = true, 0 = false).\n\nNOTE: This property is not populated through the CRUD services (`InsertEmploymentInfo`, `UpdateEmploymentInfo`). It is not present in the SQL INSERT or UPDATE statements. It exists in `SelectEmploymentInfo` output and is managed separately by payroll run processing logic.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/SelectAllPayComponentByWorkerAndPosition.gloop`]\n- Loaded into the worker's `EmploymentInfo` sub-model during payroll assembly.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `Worker` record that owns this employment info record. Enforces the one-to-one relationship between a worker and their employment details at the service layer.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Required on creation; `ValidateRequiredFields` enforces that `WorkerId` is not null.\n- Used to call `ValidateWorker` to confirm the referenced worker record exists.\n- Used to perform the pre-insert duplicate check via `SelectEmploymentInfoByWorker`; if an active record already exists for this worker, a 409 Conflict is returned and no INSERT is performed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteAllEmploymentInfoByWorker.gloop`]\n- Used as the filter in `SelectAllEmploymentInfoByWorker` to collect all active employment info IDs for a worker before iterating `DeleteEmploymentInfo` for each.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Enforced at the database level by the foreign key constraint `workerid_employment_info_fkey`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the employment info record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before the INSERT; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted as a non-null column in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the employment info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter of the service; not supplied by the API caller as an employment info field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted alongside `CreatedDate` in the INSERT statement.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the employment info record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the employment info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedBy`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to `UserId` on every UPDATE operation.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/UpdateEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the employment info record was soft-deleted; null indicates the record is active.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer when a delete is executed; not supplied by the API caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/SelectEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records (where `DeletedDate` is non-null) are excluded from all read operations.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the employment info record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time; mapped to `deleteEmploymentInfoInput.DeletedBy` before the SQL soft-delete UPDATE is executed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this employment info record has been logically removed; stored as a boolean (false = active, true = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/employment_info/SelectEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- All SELECT queries filter on `\"Deleted\" = 0`; records where `Deleted` is true are invisible to all read operations across the application.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/DeleteEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Set to true (stored as integer 1) via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same SQL statement also overwrites `RegulatoryEstablishment` and `TerminationReason` with obfuscated placeholder strings. All other fields are preserved. The record is never physically removed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/employment_info/InsertEmploymentInfo.gloop`]\n- Implicitly false (0) on INSERT; no explicit assignment is needed since the database default is 0.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
