            "description" : "The employer-side monetary amount applied for this pay component in this pay period. For `ACCRUAL_BALANCE` entries, this field stores `AccrualBalance.AccruedAmount` (total units earned within the current fiscal year at the time of payslip generation). Defaults to 0 when null.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Sourced from `PaySlip.EarningLogs.EmployerAmount` or `PaySlip.DeductionLogs.EmployerAmount` for earning/deduction entries.\n- For `ACCRUAL_BALANCE` entries, sourced from `PaySlip.AccrualBalance.AccruedAmount`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_component_log/LogPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Set as `PayComponentLog.EmployerAmount ?: 0` before INSERT or UPDATE — null is coerced to 0. Currently inactive; see the top-level model comment for context.\n\n**Example:** `0.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key referencing the `Currency` record that denominates the amounts in this log entry. Sourced from the currency sub-model of the originating earning or deduction log entry.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Sourced from `PaySlip.EarningLogs.Currency.Id` or `PaySlip.DeductionLogs.Currency.Id`. Not set for `ACCRUAL_BALANCE` entries (null).\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PaySlipId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key referencing the `Pay_Slip` record that owns this log entry. Together with `ComponentClass` and `PayComponentId`, this forms the three-part composite key used by `LogPayComponent` to detect existing records for upsert.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Set to `payslip.Id` (the Id of the newly created pay slip) for all three source arrays (earnings, deductions, accrual balances).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessTaxes.gloop`]\n- Passed to `SelectPayComponentLogByPaySlipPayComponent` to scope the tax log lookup to the current pay slip.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_component_log/LogPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Used as one of three lookup keys in `SelectPayComponentLogByPaySlipPayComponent`. Currently inactive; see the top-level model comment for context.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CompanyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key referencing the `Company` record that the pay component belongs to.\n\nNOTE: `CompanyId` is not mapped during the primary pay slip generation path in `InsertPaySlip.gloop` — it is only set via `LogPayComponent`, which is currently inactive. For all records created from `EarningLogs`, `DeductionLogs`, or `AccrualBalance` arrays in `InsertPaySlip`, `CompanyId` is null.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_component_log/LogPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Passed through to INSERT and UPDATE operations from the `PayComponentLog` input model. Currently inactive; see the top-level model comment for context.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 24, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        }
      },
