      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Pay_Slip" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the pay slip record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Populated from the database-generated key after a successful INSERT (`$getGeneratedKeys` flag set to true): `$gloopOutput.generatedKeys.Id`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/DeletePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Used as the lookup key in a SELECT-before-mutate check via `SelectPaySlip`; a null result produces a 404 response before any DML is executed.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the worker's full name at the time the pay slip was generated. Stored as a denormalized copy to preserve the historical payroll record independently of any future change to the worker's name.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after INSERT, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.WorkerName` (from the `Pay_Slip_Display` input model) before INSERT.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/DeletePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Pay Slip {Id} Worker Name'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:WorkerName, \"WorkerName\")`.\n\n**Example:** `Juan dela Cruz`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Department" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the worker's department at the time the pay slip was generated. Preserved as a denormalized copy for historical payroll records.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after INSERT, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.Department` before INSERT.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/DeletePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Pay Slip {Id} Department'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Department, \"Department\")`.\n\n**Example:** `Engineering`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PositionTitle" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the worker's position title at the time the pay slip was generated. Preserved as a denormalized copy for historical payroll records.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after INSERT, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PositionTitle` before INSERT.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/DeletePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Pay Slip {Id} Position Title'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PositionTitle, \"PositionTitle\")`.\n\n**Example:** `Software Engineer`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodDisplayName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the pay period's display name at the time the pay slip was generated. Preserved as a denormalized copy for historical payroll records.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after INSERT, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PayPeriodDisplayName` before INSERT.\n- Sensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after a successful INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/DeletePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Overwritten directly in the database during soft-delete with the placeholder string `'Deleted Pay Slip {Id} Pay Period Display Name'`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodDisplayName, \"PayPeriodDisplayName\")`.\n\n**Example:** `January 2026 - Period 1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodStartDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the pay period start date at the time the pay slip was generated. Stored as a denormalized timestamp for historical accuracy.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PayPeriodStartDate` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodStartDate, \"PayPeriodStartDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-01 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodEndDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the pay period end date at the time the pay slip was generated. Stored as a denormalized timestamp for historical accuracy.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PayPeriodEndDate` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodEndDate, \"PayPeriodEndDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodPayDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Snapshot of the pay period's scheduled pay date at the time the pay slip was generated. Stored as a denormalized timestamp for historical accuracy.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PayPeriodPayDate` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodPayDate, \"PayPeriodPayDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-20 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayrollRunType" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The type of the payroll run that generated this pay slip (e.g., `REGULAR`, `OFF_CYCLE`, `TERMINATION`). Mapped from the `PayrollRunType` input parameter of `InsertPaySlip`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from the `PayrollRunType` input parameter before INSERT. When the value is `TERMINATION`, a post-INSERT step updates the associated `EMPLOYMENT_INFO` record's `FinalPayProcessed` flag to `1` via `UpdateEmploymentInfo`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayrollRunType, \"PayrollRunType\")`.\n\n**Example:** `REGULAR`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "GrossPay" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Total gross earnings for the worker during the pay period, including all taxable and non-taxable components. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)` in the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.GrossPay` (computed during payroll processing) before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:GrossPay, \"GrossPay\")`.\n\n**Example:** `5000.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TotalDeductions" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Sum of all deductions applied to the pay slip (pre-tax and post-tax combined). Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)` in the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.TotalDeductions` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:TotalDeductions, \"TotalDeductions\")`.\n\n**Example:** `500.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "NetPay" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The worker's take-home pay after all deductions and taxes have been applied. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)` in the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.NetPay` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:NetPay, \"NetPay\")`.\n\n**Example:** `4500.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PaymentMethod" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The method by which the worker is paid (e.g., `DIRECT_DEPOSIT`, `CHECK`). Intended as a snapshot captured at the time the pay slip is generated.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is currently informational only. `PaymentMethod` is present in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL and is included in the `InsertPaySlip` and `UpdatePaySlip` SQL statements, but no service in the payroll calculation pipeline (`CalculatePay`, `ProcessEarnings`, `ProcessDeductions`, `ProcessBenefits`, `ProcessTaxes`, `ProcessPayroll`) ever assigns it a value. `PaySlipPreview.PaymentMethod` is never populated before `InsertPaySlip` is called, so it is persisted as `null` for all records created through the current service workflow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Wire-mapped from `PaySlip.PaymentMethod` to the SQL INSERT, but the source is always `null`; no calculation service populates this field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PaymentMethod, \"PaymentMethod\")`.\n\n**Example:** `Direct Deposit`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Status" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Lifecycle status of the pay slip, reflecting the state of payroll processing for this record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Set to `\"GENERATED\"` by the service layer before INSERT, regardless of caller input; callers do not supply this field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- The only service-exposed field updatable through the pay slip API. Accepted transition values: `PROCESSING`, `PROCESSED`, `PAID`, `VOID`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Status, \"Status\")`.\n\n**Example:** `PROCESSED`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Currency" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The ISO currency code for this pay slip. Intended as a snapshot captured at the time the pay slip is generated.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is currently informational only. `Currency` is present in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL and is included in the `InsertPaySlip` and `UpdatePaySlip` SQL statements, but is never mapped from the service-layer inputs. `InsertPaySlip` wire-maps `payslip.Currency` to the SQL INSERT, but `payslip.Currency` itself is never assigned during the data-transform step — `Pay_Slip_Display.Currency` is a nested object (with sub-fields `CurrencyName`, `CurrencySymbol`, `IsoCurrencyCode`, `CurrencyPrecision`), not a string, and no explicit mapping to the `VARCHAR(255)` column is performed. It is persisted as `null` for all records created through the current service workflow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- `payslip.Currency` is passed to the SQL INSERT, but is never assigned a value in the data-transform step; `Pay_Slip_Display.Currency` is a nested object and does not map to this field.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Currency, \"Currency\")`.\n\n**Example:** `USD`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
