            "description" : "Foreign key linking the pay slip to its associated pay period. Nullable at the database level.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Nullable `INTEGER` in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL. FK: `payperiodid_pay_slip_fkey` → `PAY_PERIOD(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `PaySlip.PayPeriodId` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/UpdatePaySlip.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodId, \"PayPeriodId\")`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
