          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the pay slip record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared `NOT NULL` in the `PAY_SLIP` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/pay_slip/InsertPaySlip.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer before INSERT; not supplied by the caller.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 25, 2026",
