      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Payroll_Run" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The unique identifier for the payroll run record. Auto-generated by the database on insert.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` in the `PAYROLL_RUN` DDL; the value is auto-generated by the database.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/InsertPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- The `$getGeneratedKeys` flag is set to `true`; the generated key is returned after INSERT and mapped back to the record.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DisplayName" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "A human-readable label for the payroll run, used as the primary display identifier in listings and reports. If not supplied by the caller on creation, the service auto-generates the value as `PAYROLL RUN FOR {PAY_PERIOD_DISPLAY_NAME}` (uppercased), derived from the associated pay period's `DisplayName`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/InsertPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Auto-generated on INSERT when not provided: `\"PAYROLL RUN FOR ${selectPayPeriodOutput.DisplayName.toUpperCase()}\"`.\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` before being written to the tracker audit log.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `VARCHAR(255)` with no `NOT NULL` constraint in the `PAYROLL_RUN` DDL.\n- Subject to `CONSTRAINT \"PAYROLL_RUN_unique\" UNIQUE (\"DisplayName\", \"PayPeriodId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/UpdatePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:DisplayName, \"DisplayName\")`; passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/DeletePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with a placeholder on soft-delete: `CONCAT('Deleted Payroll Run ', \"Id\", ' Display Name')`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/DeletePayrollRun.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessPayroll.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry.\n\n**Example:** `January 2020 - Period 1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "An optional free-text description providing additional context about this payroll run.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `VARCHAR(255)` with no `NOT NULL` constraint in the `PAYROLL_RUN` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/UpdatePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Description, \"Description\")`; passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/DeletePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with a placeholder on soft-delete: `CONCAT('Deleted Payroll Run ', \"Id\", ' Description')`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/InsertPayrollRun.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/DeletePayrollRun.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessPayroll.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry.\n\n**Example:** `Regular semi-monthly payroll run for January 2020.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Status" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The lifecycle state of the payroll run. Managed entirely by the service and processing layers; callers cannot set this on create.\n\nKnown states (in order):\n- `DRAFT` — initial state on creation; also restored after the preview-calculation pass completes.\n- `CALCULATING TOTALS FOR PREVIEW` — transient state set by `ProcessNewPayrollRunTotals` while computing totals.\n- `QUEUED` — set when the run is submitted for processing via the process endpoint.\n- `PROCESSING` — set by `ProcessPayroll` when active pay-slip generation is underway.\n- `PROCESSED` — terminal state set by `ProcessPayroll` upon successful completion.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/InsertPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `\"DRAFT\"` on INSERT; the caller cannot override this.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessNewPayrollRunTotals.gloop`]\n- Temporarily set to `\"CALCULATING TOTALS FOR PREVIEW\"`, then restored to `\"DRAFT\"` after totals are updated.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessPayroll.gloop`]\n- Transitions through `QUEUED → PROCESSING → PROCESSED` during payroll execution.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/UpdatePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Status, \"Status\")`; passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `PROCESSED`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
