          "ProcessDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp at which the payroll run was finalized via `ProcessPayroll`. Recorded as the system clock time (`now`) at the moment the run transitions to `PROCESSED` status.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/ProcessPayroll.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` in the final `UpdatePayrollRun` SQL invocation, at the point where `Status` is also set to `\"PROCESSED\"`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `TIMESTAMP` with no `NOT NULL` constraint in the `PAYROLL_RUN` DDL; `null` until the run is processed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/UpdatePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:ProcessDate, \"ProcessDate\")`; passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-20 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
