          "PostingDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date on which payroll funds are posted. Required on creation. The service validates that this value falls on or after the associated pay period's start date and on or before the pay period's pay date.\n\nThis field also acts as a visibility gate for worker-facing pay slip retrieval: pay slips associated with this payroll run are only returned to workers when `PostingDate <= NOW()`. Pay slips are not visible to workers before the posting date has been reached.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/payroll_run/InsertPayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Required field; validated via `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Business rule: `PostingDate` must be `>= PayPeriod.StartDate` and `<= PayPeriod.PayDate`; the service throws an exception if this range is violated.\n- Also validated by `ValidateDates` to confirm the value is a parseable date string.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `TIMESTAMP` with no `NOT NULL` constraint in the `PAYROLL_RUN` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/payroll_run/UpdatePayrollRun.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PostingDate, \"PostingDate\")`; passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/pay_slip/SelectAllPaySlipByWorker.gloop`]\n- The WHERE clause includes `\"PAYROLL_RUN\".\"PostingDate\" <= NOW()`; pay slips are excluded from worker-facing results until the posting date is reached.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-21 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 26, 2026",
