      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Position" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Unique auto-generated primary key for the position record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Defined as `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- The `$getGeneratedKeys` flag is set to `true`; the generated key is returned after INSERT and mapped back to the record.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Department" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The organizational unit or department to which this position belongs. Required on creation.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n- Part of `CONSTRAINT \"POSITION_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Title\", \"Department\", \"CompanyId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.Department` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Department, \"Department\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with a placeholder on soft-delete: `CONCAT('Deleted Position ', \"Id\", ' Department')`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete.\n\n**Example:** `Engineering`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Title" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The job title of this position. Required on creation.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n- Part of `CONSTRAINT \"POSITION_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Title\", \"Department\", \"CompanyId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.Title` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Title, \"Title\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with a placeholder on soft-delete: `CONCAT('Deleted Position ', \"Id\", ' Title')`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete.\n\n**Example:** `Software Engineer`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Frequency" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The pay frequency of this position, derived from the associated pay schedule (e.g., `WEEKLY`, `BIWEEKLY`, `MONTHLY`). Not supplied by the caller; auto-set from the linked pay schedule at INSERT time and recalculated whenever the pay schedule assignment changes on UPDATE.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from `selectPayScheduleOutput.Frequency` when `PayScheduleId` is provided; `null` when no pay schedule is assigned.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Frequency, \"Frequency\")`.\n\n**Example:** `SEMIMONTHLY`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which this position is effective. Required on creation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.EffectiveFromDate` before INSERT.\n- Validated as a parseable date string via `ValidateDates` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:EffectiveFromDate, \"EffectiveFromDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The optional expiry date of this position. When populated, it marks the end of the period during which the position is effective.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.EffectiveToDate` before INSERT.\n- Validated as a parseable date string via `ValidateDates` (validated alongside `EffectiveFromDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:EffectiveToDate, \"EffectiveToDate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Indicates whether the position is currently active. Required on creation. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = active, 0 = inactive); the service converts the boolean input (`true` → `1`, `false` → `0`) before persisting.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Converted from boolean to integer (`position.Active ? 1 : 0`) before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Active, \"Active\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Set to `0` on soft-delete.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "An optional free-text description providing additional context about this position.\n\nSensitive field: redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete, and overwritten in the database with a placeholder string on soft-delete.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.Description` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Description, \"Description\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with a placeholder on soft-delete: `CONCAT('Deleted Position ', \"Id\", ' Description')`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Redacted to `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry after soft-delete.\n\n**Example:** `Senior software engineering role.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Salaried" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Indicates whether this is a salaried position. Required on creation. Stored as an integer in the database (1 = salaried, 0 = non-salaried); the service converts the boolean input before persisting.\n\nThis flag governs `BaseRateUnit` validation: for non-salaried positions (`Salaried = false`), `BaseRateUnit` must be provided or the service throws `BaseRateUnit cannot be null for non-salaried workers.`\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Converted from boolean to integer (`position.Salaried ? 1 : 0`) before INSERT/UPDATE.\n- If `Salaried == false` and `BaseRateUnit == null`, the service throws an exception before any DML.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:Salaried, \"Salaried\")`.\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodHours" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The number of working hours in a single pay period for this position.\n\n**NOTE:** This property is currently informational only. `PayPeriodHours` is present in the `POSITION` DDL and is included in the `InsertPosition` and `UpdatePosition` SQL statements, but is never mapped from the service-layer inputs in any current service (`InsertPosition` or `UpdatePosition`). It is persisted as `null` for all records created through the current service workflow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodHours, \"PayPeriodHours\")`.\n\n**Example:** `80.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayPeriodRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The compensation amount for a single pay period, derived from `AnnualRate ÷ AnnualPayPeriods`. Computed by the `CalculateRates` service whenever a pay schedule is assigned and rates are calculated; `null` when no pay schedule is assigned. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `PayPeriodRate` output of `CalculateRates`; only computed when `PayScheduleId` is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayPeriodRate, \"PayPeriodRate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `5000.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WeeklyDays" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The number of working days per week for this position. Required on creation. Used by `CalculateRates` to derive the daily rate when `BaseRateUnit = DAY` (working days in year = weekly hours × weeks in year ÷ daily hours). Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.WeeklyDays` before INSERT; passed to `CalculateRates`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:WeeklyDays, \"WeeklyDays\")`.\n\n**Example:** `5.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WeeklyHours" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The number of working hours per week for this position. Required on creation. Used by `CalculateRates` to compute both daily and hourly rates. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.WeeklyHours` before INSERT; passed to `CalculateRates`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:WeeklyHours, \"WeeklyHours\")`.\n\n**Example:** `40.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "BaseRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The base rate of pay — either the daily or hourly rate, whichever applies to this position. Computed after `CalculateRates` as `DailyRate ?: HourlyRate`. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Set to `$gloopOutput.DailyRate ?: $gloopOutput.HourlyRate` after `CalculateRates` completes.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via **direct assignment** (`:BaseRate`), not `COALESCE`; passing `null` will explicitly clear the stored value.\n\n**Example:** `120000.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "BaseRateUnit" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Specifies whether the worker is paid on a daily (`DAY`) or hourly (`HOUR`) basis, determining which derived rate (`DailyRate` or `HourlyRate`) `CalculateRates` computes. Required for non-salaried positions.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- If `Salaried == false` and `BaseRateUnit == null`, the service throws `BaseRateUnit cannot be null for non-salaried workers.` before any DML.\n- Passed directly to `CalculateRates` to determine which rate branch to compute.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via **direct assignment** (`:BaseRateUnit`), not `COALESCE`; passing `null` will explicitly clear the stored value.\n\n**Example:** `HOUR`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true,
            "enum" : [ "DAY", "HOUR" ]
          },
          "AnnualRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The annual salary for this position, used as the basis for all derived rate calculations. Required on creation. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.AnnualRate` before INSERT; passed to `CalculateRates` as the input salary.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:AnnualRate, \"AnnualRate\")`.\n\n**Example:** `120000.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DailyRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The compensation amount per working day. Computed by `CalculateRates` as `AnnualRate ÷ WorkingDaysInYear` when `BaseRateUnit = DAY`; `null` otherwise. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `DailyRate` output of `CalculateRates`; only set when `BaseRateUnit = DAY`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via **direct assignment** (`:DailyRate`), not `COALESCE`; passing `null` will explicitly clear the stored value.\n\n**Example:** `461.54`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "HourlyRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The compensation amount per working hour. Computed by `CalculateRates` as `AnnualRate ÷ WorkingHoursInYear` when `BaseRateUnit = HOUR`; `null` otherwise. Stored as `DECIMAL(10,2)`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `HourlyRate` output of `CalculateRates`; only set when `BaseRateUnit = HOUR`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via **direct assignment** (`:HourlyRate`), not `COALESCE`; passing `null` will explicitly clear the stored value.\n\n**Example:** `57.69`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PayScheduleId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key linking the position to its assigned pay schedule. Positions without a pay schedule are excluded from regular payroll runs; both `InsertPosition` and `UpdatePosition` issue a warning when this field is absent. When provided, the referenced pay schedule is validated via `ValidatePaySchedule` before rate calculations proceed.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Nullable `INTEGER` in the `POSITION` DDL. FK: `payscheduleid_position_fkey` → `PAY_SCHEDULE(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- When `null`, a warning is appended: `\"Workers assigned with this Position will not be included in payroll runs for regular pay periods.\"`.\n- When provided, `ValidatePaySchedule` is called before rate calculations.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:PayScheduleId, \"PayScheduleId\")`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CompanyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key linking the position to the company it belongs to. Required on creation (`NOT NULL` in DDL). Part of the uniqueness constraint with `Title` and `Department`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL. FK: `companyid_position_fkey` → `COMPANY(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n- Part of `CONSTRAINT \"POSITION_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Title\", \"Department\", \"CompanyId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.CompanyId` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:CompanyId, \"CompanyId\")`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CurrencyId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Optional foreign key linking the position to the currency in which the worker is paid.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Nullable `INTEGER` in the `POSITION` DDL. FK: `currencyid_position_fkey` → `CURRENCY(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `position.CurrencyId` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:CurrencyId, \"CurrencyId\")`.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the position record was first inserted into the database.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) before INSERT; not supplied by the caller.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who created the position record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter before INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp of the most recent modification to the position record, maintained automatically by the service layer on every write operation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` on INSERT (same value as `CreatedDate`).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedDate, \"UpdatedDate\")`; all service-layer callers that invoke this SQL set `:UpdatedDate` to `now`.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified the position record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/InsertPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/UpdatePosition.gloop`]\n- Updated via `COALESCE(:UpdatedBy, \"UpdatedBy\")`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Timestamp recording when the position record was soft-deleted; `null` indicates an active record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Set to the current server timestamp (`now`) by the service layer at delete time; not supplied by the caller.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPosition.gloop`]\n- These core lookup queries enforce `\"Deleted\" = 0`, excluding soft-deleted records.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByPay_Schedule.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionByCurrency.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByCurrency.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByPay_Schedule.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByCurrency.gloop`]\n- These selectors project `Deleted` fields without applying a `POSITION.Deleted = 0` filter and may return soft-deleted records.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Identifier of the user who soft-deleted the position record, used for audit trail purposes.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Populated from the `UserId` input parameter at delete time.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Persisted via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` in the soft-delete UPDATE statement.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "Soft-delete flag indicating whether this position record has been logically removed; stored as an integer in the database (0 = active, 1 = deleted).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0` in the `POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPosition.gloop`]\n- These core lookup queries enforce `\"Deleted\" = 0`, so soft-deleted records are excluded from those paths.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionByPay_Schedule.gloop`]\n- Enforces `POSITION.Deleted = 0`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByPay_Schedule.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionByCurrency.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectPositionByCurrency.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByPay_Schedule.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByCompany.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position/SelectAllPositionGroupByCurrency.gloop`]\n- These selectors expose `Deleted` values without explicitly filtering `POSITION.Deleted = 0`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position/DeletePosition.gloop`]\n- Set to `1` via the soft-delete SQL UPDATE. The same statement also sets `Active = 0`, records `DeletedDate` and `DeletedBy`, and overwrites `Department`, `Title`, and `Description` with placeholder strings. The record is never physically removed.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties" : false
      },
