      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Position_Pay_Component" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The system-generated primary key for the position pay component record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/InsertPositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Retrieved on INSERT via `$getGeneratedKeys = true`. The generated value is mapped back to the service response.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "ComponentClass" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "Classifies the compensation element assigned to this position. Must be `'EARNING'` or `'BENEFIT'`. This value determines which of `EarningId` or `BenefitId` must be provided and is the primary routing key for all component-type validation.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL. No `CHECK` constraint is defined at the database level.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position_pay_component/InsertPositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. Validated by `ValidateRequiredFields` alongside `PositionId`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position_pay_component/ValidatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Must be `'EARNING'` or `'BENEFIT'`. Routes validation logic to the appropriate component-type branch, enforcing mutual exclusivity of `EarningId` and `BenefitId`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. The `UpdatePositionPayComponent` service does not map `ComponentClass` from its input, so this field is immutable after creation.\n\n**Example:** `EARNING`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true,
            "enum" : [ "EARNING", "BENEFIT" ]
          },
          "CustomEmployeeAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "An optional position-level override for the employee-side contribution amount. When provided, this value replaces the default `EmployeeAmount` defined on the underlying `Earning` or `Benefit` record for all workers assigned to this position. When `null`, the component's default employee amount applies.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,3)` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses **direct assignment** on UPDATE (no `COALESCE`). Passing `null` will explicitly clear the override.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CustomEmployerAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "An optional position-level override for the employer-side contribution amount. When provided, this value replaces the default `EmployerAmount` defined on the underlying `Earning` or `Benefit` record for all workers assigned to this position. When `null`, the component's default employer amount applies.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `DECIMAL(10,3)` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses **direct assignment** on UPDATE (no `COALESCE`). Passing `null` will explicitly clear the override.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PositionId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key to the `POSITION` table. Identifies the position to which this compensation element is assigned.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n- FK constraint `positionid_position_pay_component_fkey`: references `POSITION(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position_pay_component/InsertPositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. Validated by `ValidateRequiredFields` alongside `ComponentClass`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. The `UpdatePositionPayComponent` service does not map `PositionId` from its input, so this field is immutable after creation.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "BenefitId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key to the `BENEFIT` table. Populated when `ComponentClass = 'BENEFIT'`; must be `null` when `ComponentClass = 'EARNING'`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n- FK constraint `benefitid_position_pay_component_fkey`: references `BENEFIT(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position_pay_component/ValidatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Required when `ComponentClass = 'BENEFIT'`. Must not be provided when `ComponentClass = 'EARNING'`. Validated for existence via `ValidateBenefit` and checked for duplicate assignment to the same position.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. The `UpdatePositionPayComponent` service does not map `BenefitId` from its input, so this field is immutable after creation.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
