            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EarningId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "Foreign key to the `EARNING` table. Populated when `ComponentClass = 'EARNING'`; must be `null` when `ComponentClass = 'BENEFIT'`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `INTEGER` (nullable) in the `POSITION_PAY_COMPONENT` DDL.\n- FK constraint `earningid_position_pay_component_fkey`: references `EARNING(Id)` ON DELETE CASCADE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/position_pay_component/ValidatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Required when `ComponentClass = 'EARNING'`. Must not be provided when `ComponentClass = 'BENEFIT'`. Validated for existence via `ValidateEarning` and checked for duplicate assignment to the same position.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/position_pay_component/UpdatePositionPayComponent.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. The `UpdatePositionPayComponent` service does not map `EarningId` from its input, so this field is immutable after creation.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
