      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Scope_1" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The system-generated primary key for the scope record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` in the `SCOPE` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/scope/InsertScope.gloop`]\n- Retrieved on INSERT via `$getGeneratedKeys = true`. The generated value is mapped back to the service response.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
