          "ApiEndpoint" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The API path that this scope protects (e.g., `'/api/lonti_app_payroll/1.0/position'`). Used by `ROLE_SCOPE` mappings to resolve which endpoint a given role permission applies to.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)` (nullable) in the `SCOPE` DDL. No `UNIQUE` or `NOT NULL` constraint is defined at the database level.\n- Endpoint paths are established by the seed data `INSERT` statements in `Setup.gloop`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/scope/InsertScope.gloop`]\n- Mapped directly from caller input. No required-field or format validation is performed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/scope/UpdateScope.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
