            "description" : "A human-readable description of the scope's purpose (e.g., `'View (all) create and update Position.'`). Used for administrative clarity; not evaluated at runtime during permission checks.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `VARCHAR(255)` (nullable) in the `SCOPE` DDL.\n- Descriptions are established by the seed data `INSERT` statements in `Setup.gloop`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/scope/InsertScope.gloop`]\n- Mapped directly from caller input. No validation is performed.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/scope/UpdateScope.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE. Passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
