            "description" : "Timestamp recording when this scope was created.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- Declared as `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `SCOPE` DDL.\n- Seeded with `NOW()` in the initial `INSERT` statements.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/scope/InsertScope.gloop`]\n- Mapped directly from `scope.CreatedDate` in the caller input. Unlike most other insert services, the value is **not** auto-set to `now` — the caller is responsible for providing it.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
