            "description" : "Identifier of the user who last modified this record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/scope/InsertScope.gloop`]\n- Mapped directly from `scope.UpdatedBy` in the caller input.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/scope/UpdateScope.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` on UPDATE.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 27, 2026",
