      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Statutory_Compliance" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `STATUTORY_COMPLIANCE` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT and returned to the service layer via the `$getGeneratedKeys` mechanism.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — value is database-generated; the service layer does not supply it on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` is set to `true`; the generated `Id` is mapped back to the input model after INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The name identifying the statutory compliance type for the worker (e.g., SSS, PhilHealth, Pag-IBIG, TIN). Together with `WorkerId`, this field forms the unique identity of the record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n- Part of the `STATUTORY_COMPLIANCE_unique` constraint: `UNIQUE (\"Name\", \"WorkerId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Statutory Compliance ' + Id + ' Name'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `Social Security Number`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Number" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The worker's government-issued identifier number for this compliance type (e.g., SSS number, PhilHealth number, TIN). This is the actual statutory ID value associated with the compliance `Name`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Statutory Compliance ' + Id + ' Number'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `123-45-6789`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which this statutory compliance record is effective. Defines the start boundary of the compliance validity period.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on INSERT (date format and range checks).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on UPDATE, using both the new and current date values as context.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date on which this statutory compliance record expires. Defines the end boundary of the compliance validity period. Optional — a record without an end date represents an open-ended compliance.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Included in `ValidateDates` on INSERT if a value is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on UPDATE when a value is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key linking this compliance record to its owning worker in the `WORKER` table. Required on INSERT and effectively immutable after creation — the `UpdateStatutoryCompliance` service does not expose this field in its input model.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `workerid_statutory_compliance_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"WorkerId\") REFERENCES \"WORKER\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n- Part of the `STATUTORY_COMPLIANCE_unique` constraint: `UNIQUE (\"Name\", \"WorkerId\")`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Worker existence is validated via `ValidateWorker` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Not included in the service input model; `WorkerId` cannot be changed after creation.\n- The UPDATE SQL maps `WorkerId` via `COALESCE(:WorkerId, \"WorkerId\")`, but since the service never supplies a value, the existing `WorkerId` is always preserved.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
