          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the statutory compliance record was first created. Set automatically by the service layer on INSERT and not modifiable through the update flow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who created the statutory compliance record. Captured from the authenticated `UserId` at the time of INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `UserId` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input directly.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp of the most recent write to the statutory compliance record. Set automatically on INSERT and updated on every subsequent modification.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/InsertStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/statutory_compliance/UpdateStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE; updated by passing the current timestamp from the service layer.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
