            "description" : "The timestamp when the statutory compliance record was soft-deleted. Null for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/statutory_compliance/DeleteStatutoryCompliance.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` when a soft delete is performed.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
