      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Tax" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `TAX` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT and returned to the service layer via the `$getGeneratedKeys` mechanism.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — value is database-generated; the service layer does not supply it on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` is set to `true`; the generated `Id` is mapped back to the input model after INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Name" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The display name of the tax. Must be globally unique across all records in the `TAX` table.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n- `CONSTRAINT \"TAX_Name_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Name\")` — global uniqueness enforced at the database level.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Tax ' + Id + ' Name'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `Federal Income Tax`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Code" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "A short identifier code for the tax. Must be globally unique across all records in the `TAX` table.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n- `CONSTRAINT \"TAX_Code_unique\" UNIQUE (\"Code\")` — global uniqueness enforced at the database level.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Tax ' + Id + ' Code'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `FIT`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Description" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "A human-readable description of the tax. Informational only — this field is not used in payroll calculation logic.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Tax ' + Id + ' Description'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `Federal income tax withholding.`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Active" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "A flag indicating whether the tax is active. Currently informational only — active-status filtering is not yet implemented in payroll processing (tracked as PAYROLL-159). On soft delete, this field is explicitly set to `0` regardless of its prior value.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Boolean input is converted to integer (`1`/`0`) before persistence; `null` input persists as `null`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Explicitly set to `0` on soft delete (direct assignment, not `COALESCE`).\n\n**Example:** `true`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "FilingStatus" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The tax filing status classification (e.g., single, married, head of household). Stored for reference only — this field is not used in the current payroll calculation logic.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Overwritten with `'Deleted Tax ' + Id + ' Filing Status'` on soft delete.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Replaced with `\"Redacted\"` in the tracker audit log entry before the delete event is logged.\n\n**Example:** `Single`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveFromDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date from which this tax configuration is effective. Informational only — there is no date-based activation logic in the current service; the field is not used to filter or activate taxes in payroll processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on INSERT (date format check).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on UPDATE when a value is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EffectiveToDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The date on which this tax configuration expires. Informational only — there is no date-based expiry logic in the current service; the field is not used to deactivate taxes in payroll processing.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on INSERT if a value is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Validated by `ValidateDates` on UPDATE when a value is provided.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `2099-12-31 00:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployeeAmount" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The employee-side tax amount or rate used as the base value in tax calculations. The interpretation of this value depends on `EmployeeCalculationMethodId` (e.g., flat amount, percentage).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `DECIMAL(10,3)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/DeleteTax.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved for audit purposes.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "EmployeeCalculationMethodId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "A foreign key reference to the `CALCULATION_METHOD` table, specifying how `EmployeeAmount` is applied in payroll calculations (e.g., flat rate, percentage of gross).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL. No database-level foreign key constraint is defined for this column.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/InsertTax.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod` to confirm the referenced record exists.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Validated via `ValidateCalculationMethod` when a value is provided on UPDATE.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax/UpdateTax.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "IsEmployerTax" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
