      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Tax_Schedule" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `TAX_SCHEDULE` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT and returned to the service layer via the `$getGeneratedKeys` mechanism.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — value is database-generated; the service layer does not supply it on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_schedule/InsertTaxSchedule.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` is set to `true`; the generated `Id` is mapped back to the response after INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
