          },
          "LowerLimit" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "The lower boundary (inclusive) of the tax bracket range. Together with `UpperLimit`, defines the taxable-amount range to which this bracket applies. Used directly in the progressive tax formula: `BaseAmount + (PercentDeduction × (TaxableAmount − LowerLimit))`.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `DECIMAL(10,2) NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_schedule/InsertTaxSchedule.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: service validates that `LowerLimit < UpperLimit` before persisting.\n- Overlap-checked against existing brackets for the same `TaxId` via `SelectAllTaxScheduleByTax`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_schedule/UpdateTaxSchedule.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_schedule/DeleteTaxSchedule.gloop`]\n- Commented out in the soft-delete SQL — not cleared on delete; the field is preserved for historical audit purposes.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
