      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Tax_Applicability" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `TAX_APPLICABILITY` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT and returned to the service layer via the `$getGeneratedKeys` mechanism.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — value is database-generated; the service layer does not supply it on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` is set to `true`; the generated `Id` is mapped back to the response after INSERT.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "TaxId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key linking this applicability record to its parent tax configuration in the `TAX` table. Required on INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `taxid_tax_applicability_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"TaxId\") REFERENCES \"TAX\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Tax existence validated via `ValidateTax` before INSERT.\n- Used as part of the duplicate assignment check.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/UpdateTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CountryId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the country to which this tax applies. Required on INSERT. When `StateId` is null, this record represents a country-wide assignment.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `countryid_tax_applicability_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"CountryId\") REFERENCES \"COUNTRY\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT: validated by `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- Country existence validated before INSERT.\n- Used as part of the duplicate assignment check.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/UpdateTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "StateId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the state to which this tax applies. Optional — when null, the record represents a country-level assignment; when set, it represents a state-specific assignment.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `stateid_tax_applicability_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"StateId\") REFERENCES \"STATE\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT: not included in `ValidateRequiredFields`.\n- When provided, both the country and state are validated for existence before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/UpdateTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Uses **direct assignment** on UPDATE (`\"StateId\" = :StateId`), not `COALESCE`. Passing `null` will explicitly clear `StateId`, converting a state-level assignment to a country-level one.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the tax applicability record was first created. Set automatically by the service layer on INSERT and not modifiable through the update flow.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who created the tax applicability record. Captured from the authenticated `UserId` at the time of INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `UserId` on INSERT; never mapped from service-layer input directly.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp of the most recent write to the tax applicability record. Set automatically on INSERT and updated on every subsequent modification.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Auto-set to `now` on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/UpdateTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE; updated by passing the current timestamp from the service layer.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who last modified the tax applicability record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/InsertTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Mapped from `UserId` on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/UpdateTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the tax applicability record was soft-deleted. Null for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/tax_applicability/DeleteTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Set to `now` when a soft delete is performed.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "DeletedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who performed the soft delete. Null for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/DeleteTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Set via `COALESCE(:DeletedBy, \"DeletedBy\")` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "Deleted" : {
            "type" : "boolean",
            "description" : "The soft-delete flag for this record. `0` (false) indicates an active assignment; `1` (true) indicates the record has been soft-deleted and is excluded from standard queries.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/tax_applicability/DeleteTaxApplicability.gloop`]\n- Set to `1` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `false`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          }
        },
