          "UserId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the user receiving the role assignment. Together with `RoleId`, must be unique across all active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER NOT NULL`.\n- `USER_ROLE_unique`: `CONSTRAINT \"USER_ROLE_unique\" UNIQUE (\"RoleId\", \"UserId\")` — duplicate (`RoleId`, `UserId`) pairs are rejected at the database level.\n- `userid_user_role_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"UserId\") REFERENCES \"USER\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/user_role/InsertUserRole.gloop`]\n- Required at INSERT time via the `NOT NULL` database constraint; the service does not call `ValidateRequiredFields` before INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/user_role/UpdateUserRole.gloop`]\n- Uses `COALESCE` in UPDATE: passing `null` preserves the existing value.\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
