      "lonti_app_payroll_model_Worker_Position" : {
        "properties" : {
          "Id" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The surrogate primary key of the `WORKER_POSITION` table. Auto-generated by the database on INSERT. Although `$getGeneratedKeys` defaults to `false` in the SQL file, the `InsertWorkerPosition` service overrides this to `true` at runtime, ensuring the generated `Id` is captured and returned in the response.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `SERIAL PRIMARY KEY` — database-generated; never supplied by the service layer on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- `$getGeneratedKeys` defaults to `false` in the SQL file, but the service overrides it to `true` at runtime via a `set` step before invoking the SQL, so the generated `Id` is returned in the response.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CustomAnnualRate" : {
            "type" : "number",
            "description" : "Optional annual compensation rate override for this worker's position assignment. When set, this value takes precedence over the position's default rate during payroll calculation. When `null`, the position's rate is used.\n\nUses **direct assignment** on UPDATE: passing `null` will explicitly clear the override. Preserved on soft delete (the `SET` clause is commented out in the delete SQL).\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `DECIMAL(10,2)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Optional on INSERT.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateBatchWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Uses **direct assignment** on UPDATE (`\"CustomAnnualRate\" = :CustomAnnualRate`), not `COALESCE`. Passing `null` will explicitly clear this override.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/DeleteWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/DeleteBatchWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Not modified on soft delete (SET clause commented out); current value is preserved.\n\n**Example:** `0.00`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "double",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "PositionId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key referencing the `POSITION` record this worker is assigned to. Required on INSERT. Can be re-assigned via `UpdateWorkerPosition` with re-validation against the new position.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `positionid_worker_position_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"PositionId\") REFERENCES \"POSITION\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`. SQL-level cascade will delete all `WORKER_POSITION` rows when a `POSITION` record is hard-deleted; in practice, `DeletePosition` performs a soft delete and enforces an application-layer deletion guard before proceeding (see top-level comment).\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. The service validates the referenced position via `ValidatePosition`; if the position does not exist, it returns HTTP 404 before attempting the insert.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/UpdateWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Optional on UPDATE. When provided, the position is re-validated via `ValidatePosition` before the update proceeds. Uses `COALESCE(:PositionId, \"PositionId\")` in the update SQL, so omitting it leaves the existing value unchanged.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "WorkerId" : {
            "type" : "integer",
            "description" : "The foreign key identifying the worker assigned to this position. Required on INSERT. Effectively immutable post-INSERT — `WorkerId` is absent from the `UpdateWorkerPosition` service input and is always preserved via `COALESCE(null, \"WorkerId\")` on UPDATE.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `INTEGER`, nullable in DDL.\n- `workerid_worker_position_fkey`: `FOREIGN KEY (\"WorkerId\") REFERENCES \"WORKER\" (\"Id\") ON DELETE CASCADE`. SQL-level cascade will delete all `WORKER_POSITION` rows when a `WORKER` record is hard-deleted; in practice, `DeleteWorker` performs a soft delete and invokes `DeleteAllWorkerPositionByWorker` as part of the cascade.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Required on INSERT. The service validates the referenced worker via `ValidateWorker`; if the worker does not exist, it returns HTTP 404 before attempting the insert.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/UpdateWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Absent from the `UpdateWorkerPosition` service input. Uses `COALESCE(null, \"WorkerId\")` in the update SQL, making it effectively immutable post-INSERT through the service layer.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/service/worker_position/DeleteAllWorkerPositionByWorker.gloop`]\n- All `WORKER_POSITION` records for this worker are soft-deleted as part of the `DeleteWorker` service cascade.\n\n**Example:** `1`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "format" : "int32",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp when the worker position assignment record was first created. Set automatically by the service layer on INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `WORKER_POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated on INSERT from service-layer input.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "CreatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who created this record. Captured from the authenticated `UserId` at the time of INSERT.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated on INSERT from service-layer input.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedDate" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The timestamp of the most recent write to this record. Set on INSERT and updated on every subsequent modification.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP NOT NULL` in the `WORKER_POSITION` DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated on INSERT from service-layer input.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateBatchWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Updated on every UPDATE; the service passes the current timestamp.\n\n**Example:** `2026-01-15 08:00:00.000`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
          },
          "UpdatedBy" : {
            "type" : "string",
            "description" : "The identifier of the user who last modified this record.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `VARCHAR(255)`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/InsertWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Populated on INSERT from service-layer input.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/UpdateBatchWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Updated on every UPDATE; the service passes the authenticated `UserId`.\n\n**Example:** `admin`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
            "nullable" : true
