            "description" : "The timestamp when this record was soft-deleted. `null` for active records.\n\nRules derived from codebase references:\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/config/Setup.gloop`]\n- `TIMESTAMP`, nullable in DDL.\n\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/DeleteWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n[`lonti_app_payroll/sql/worker_position/DeleteBatchWorkerPosition.gloop`]\n- Set via `COALESCE(:DeletedDate, \"DeletedDate\")` on soft delete.\n\n**Example:** `null`\n\n---\n\n**Author:** SaaS Team  \n**Version:** 1.0  \n**Since:** March 28, 2026",
